Rust 도메인 모델링 AI 도구로서 엔티티와 값 객체의 설계 선택과 불변량 유지에 사용됩니다","es":"m09-domain es un sistema de asistencia de IA que ayuda a los desarrolladores de Rust a modelar dominios y tomar decisiones de diseño informadas","fr":"m09-domain est un système d''assistance d''IA qui aide les développeurs Rust à modéliser des domaines et à prendre des décisions de conception éclairées","de":"m09-domain ist ein KI-Unterstützungs-System, das Rust-Entwicklern hilft, Domänen zu modellieren und informierte Designentscheidungen zu treffen","pt":"O m09-domain é um sistema de assistência em Rust que fornece orientação sobre modelagem de domínio e padrões de código","ru":"m09-domain - это система помощи в Rust, обеспечивающая рекомендации по моделированию домена и шаблонам кода","ar":"m09-domain هو نظام دعم في الرست يقدم إرشادات حول نمذجة المجال و أنماط الكود"},"features":{"en":["Identifies Entities and Value Objects for efficient domain modeling","Determines invariants and aggregate boundaries for robust code","Maps Domain Concepts to Rust Patterns for optimized development","Applies ownership implications for unique identifiers and struct management","Supports Layer 2 design choices for informed decision-making"],"zh":["实体和值对象的设计选择","不变量维护","聚合边界的确定","Rust结构体和Id的使用","所有权和唯一标识的管理"],"ja":["エンティティと値オブジェクトの設計選択","不変量の維持","集約境界の決定","Rust構造体とIdの使用","所有権と一意の識別子の管理"],"ko":["엔티티와 값 객체의 설계 선택","불변량 유지","집합 경계의 결정","Rust 구조체와 Id의 사용","소유권과 고유 식별자의 관리"],"es":["Modelado de dominio con entidades y objetos de valor","Identificación de invariables y límites de agregados","Asignación de patrones de Rust para conceptos de dominio","Gestión de la propiedad y la identidad única","Indexación del conocimiento basada en problemas"],"fr":["Modélisation de domaine avec des entités et des objets de valeur","Identification d''invariants et de limites d''agrégats","Assignation de modèles Rust pour des concepts de domaine","Gestion de la propriété et de l''identité unique","Indexation des connaissances basée sur les problèmes"],"de":["Domänenmodellierung mit Entitäten und Wertobjekten","Identifizierung von Invarianten und Aggregatgrenzen","Zuweisung von Rust-Mustern für Domänenkonzepte","Verwaltung von Eigentum und eindeutiger Identität","Indexierung von Wissen basierend auf Problemen"],"pt":["Modelagem de domínio com entidades e objetos de valor","Definição de invariâncias e limites de agregação","Mapeamento de conceitos de domínio para padrões de Rust","Gerenciamento de identidade e propriedade com structs e IDs","Integração com bibliotecas e frameworks de Rust"],"ru":["Моделирование домена с сущностями и объектами значения","Определение инвариантов и границ агрегации","Отображение концепций домена на шаблоны Rust","Управление идентификаторами и собственностью с помощью structs и IDs","Интеграция с библиотеками и фреймворками Rust"],"ar":["نمذجة المجال باستخدام الكيانات وأجسام القيمة","تحديد الثوابت وحدود التجميع","خريطة المفاهيم المجالية إلى أنماط الرست","إدارة الهوية والملكية باستخدام الهياكل والتعريفات","تكامل مع المكتبات والأطر العمل في الرست"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use m09-domain","m09-domain rust development","domain modeling with m09-domain","m09-domain vs domain-driven design","m09-domain setup guide","m09-domain install for rust developers"],"zh":["Rust领域建模","AI工具","实体和值对象","不变量维护","Rust结构体","Id和所有权","m09-domain","Rust开发","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Rustドメインモデリング","AIエージェント","エンティティと値オブジェクト","不変量の維持","Rust構造体","Idと所有権","m09-domain","Rust開発","ドメインモデリング"],"ko":["Rust 도메인 모델링","AI 도구","엔티티와 값 객체","불변량 유지","Rust 구조체","Id와 소유권","m09-domain","Rust 개발","도메인 모델링"],"es":["m09-domain","desarrollo de Rust","agentes de IA","modelado de dominio","patrones de Rust","indexación del conocimiento","entidades y objetos de valor","invariables y límites de agregados"],"fr":["m09-domain","développement Rust","outils d''IA","modélisation de domaine","modèles Rust","indexation des connaissances","entités et objets de valeur","invariants et limites d''agrégats"],"de":["m09-domain","Rust-Entwicklung","KI-Agenten","Domänenmodellierung","Rust-Muster","Indexierung von Wissen","Entitäten und Wertobjekte","Invariante und Aggregatgrenzen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de sistemas de assistência em Rust","modelagem de domínio em Rust","padrões de código em Rust","desenvolvimento de aplicações em Rust","sistemas de assistência em Rust","Rust para desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento em Rust"],"ru":["разработка систем помощи в Rust","моделирование домена в Rust","шаблоны кода в Rust","разработка приложений в Rust","системы помощи в Rust","Rust для разработчиков","инструменты разработки в Rust"],"ar":["تنمية أنظمة الدعم في الرست","نمذجة المجال في الرست","أنماط الكود في الرست","تنمية التطبيقات في الرست","نظم الدعم في الرست","الرست لمنشئي التطبيقات","أدوات التنمية في الرست"]}},"owner":"actionbook","repo":"rust-skills","repoPath":"actionbook/rust-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.275Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m09-domain","description":"CRITICAL: Use for domain modeling. Triggers: domain model, DDD, domain-driven design, entity, value object, aggregate, repository pattern, business rules, validation, invariant, 领域模型, 领域驱动设计, 业务规则","bodyPreview":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique ident","body":"# Domain Modeling\n\n> **Layer 2: Design Choices**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**What is this concept''s role in the domain?**\n\nBefore modeling in code, understand:\n- Is it an Entity (identity matters) or Value Object (interchangeable)?\n- What invariants must be maintained?\n- Where are the aggregate boundaries?\n\n---\n\n## Domain Concept → Rust Pattern\n\n| Domain Concept | Rust Pattern | Ownership Implication |\n|----------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| Entity | struct + Id | Owned, unique identity |\n| Value Object | struct + Clone/Copy | Shareable, immutable |\n| Aggregate Root | struct owns children | Clear ownership tree |\n| Repository | trait | Abstracts persistence |\n| Domain Event | enum | Captures state changes |\n| Service | impl block / free fn | Stateless operations |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore creating a domain type:\n\n1. **What''s the concept''s identity?**\n   - Needs unique identity → Entity (Id field)\n   - Interchangeable by value → Value Object (Clone/Copy)\n\n2. **What invariants must hold?**\n   - Always valid → private fields + validated constructor\n   - Transition rules → type state pattern\n\n3. **Who owns this data?**\n   - Single owner (parent) → owned field\n   - Shared reference → Arc/Rc\n   - Weak reference → Weak\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nTo domain constraints (Layer 3):\n\n```\n\"How should I model a Transaction?\"\n    ↑ Ask: What domain rules govern transactions?\n    ↑ Check: domain-fintech (audit, precision requirements)\n    ↑ Check: Business stakeholders (what invariants?)\n```\n\n| Design Question | Trace To | Ask |\n|-----------------|----------|-----|\n| Entity vs Value Object | domain-* | What makes two instances \"the same\"? |\n| Aggregate boundaries | domain-* | What must be consistent together? |\n| Validation rules | domain-* | What business rules apply? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nTo implementation (Layer 1):\n\n```\n\"Model as Entity\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Owned, unique\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Newtype for Id\n\n\"Model as Value Object\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Clone/Copy OK\n    ↓ m05-type-driven: Validate at construction\n\n\"Model as Aggregate\"\n    ↓ m01-ownership: Parent owns children\n    ↓ m02-resource: Consider Rc for shared within aggregate\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| DDD Concept | Rust Pattern | Example |\n|-------------|--------------|---------|\n| Value Object | Newtype | `struct Email(String);` |\n| Entity | Struct + ID | `struct User { id: UserId, ... }` |\n| Aggregate | Module boundary | `mod order { ... }` |\n| Repository | Trait | `trait UserRepo { fn find(...) }` |\n| Domain Event | Enum | `enum OrderEvent { Created, ... }` |\n\n## Pattern Templates\n\n### Value Object\n\n```rust\nstruct Email(String);\n\nimpl Email {\n    pub fn new(s: &str) -> Result<Self, ValidationError> {\n        validate_email(s)?;\n        Ok(Self(s.to_string()))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Entity\n\n```rust\nstruct UserId(Uuid);\n\nstruct User {\n    id: UserId,\n    email: Email,\n    // ... other fields\n}\n\nimpl PartialEq for User {\n    fn eq(&self, other: &Self) -> bool {\n        self.id == other.id  // Identity equality\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Aggregate\n\n```rust\nmod order {\n    pub struct Order {\n        id: OrderId,\n        items: Vec<OrderItem>,  // Owned children\n        // ...\n    }\n\n    impl Order {\n        pub fn add_item(&mut self, item: OrderItem) {\n            // Enforce aggregate invariants\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Why Wrong | Better |\n|---------|-----------|--------|\n| Primitive obsession | No type safety | Newtype wrappers |\n| Public fields with invariants | Invariants violated | Private + accessor |\n| Leaked aggregate internals | Broken encapsulation | Methods on root |\n| String for semantic types | No validation | Validated newtype |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Type-driven implementation | m05-type-driven |\n| Ownership for aggregates | m01-ownership |\n| Domain error handling | m13-domain-error |\n| Specific domain rules | domain-* |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:37.917Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust Developer Agents needing efficient domain modeling and code optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的领域建模和代码优化能力的Rust开发者代理。","ja":"Rust開発者エージェントが効率的なドメインモデリングとコード最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 도메인 모델링 및 코드 최적화 기능이 필요한 Rust 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de Rust que necesitan capacidades de modelado de dominio eficientes y optimización de código.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Rust qui ont besoin de capacités de modélisation de domaine efficaces et d''optimisation de code.","de":"Perfekt für Rust-Entwicklungsagenten, die effiziente Domänenmodellierung und Code-Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedores Rust que precisam de modelagem de domínio eficiente e capacidades de otimização de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков Rust, которым необходима эффективная модель домена и возможности оптимизации кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مطور رست الذي يحتاج إلى نمذجة نطاق كفء وقدرات تحسين الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to guide Rust developers through design choices and entity identification using a meta-problem-driven knowledge indexing system, maintaining invariants and aggregate boundaries with Rust patterns like struct + Id for Entities.","zh":"赋予代理引导Rust开发者完成设计选择和实体识别，使用元问题驱动的知识索引系统，维护不变量和聚合边界，使用Rust模式，如struct + Id的实体。","ja":"エージェントは、メタプロブレムドリブンのナレッジインデックスシステムを使用して、Rust開発者を設計選択とエンティティ識別のプロセスでサポートし、Rustパターン（例：struct + Idによるエンティティ）を使用して不変量と集約境界を維持します。","ko":"에이전트가 메타 문제 驱动의 知識 색인 시스템을 사용하여 Rust 개발자를 설계 선택 및 엔티티 식별의 과정에서 지원하고, Rust 패턴(예: struct + Id에 의한 엔티티)을 사용하여 불변量과 집합 경계를 유지합니다.","es":"Habilite a los agentes para guiar a los desarrolladores de Rust a través de elecciones de diseño y identificación de entidades utilizando un sistema de indexación de conocimiento basado en problemas meta, manteniendo invariantes y límites de agregados con patrones de Rust como struct + Id para entidades.","fr":"Permet aux agents de guider les développeurs Rust à travers les choix de conception et l''identification d''entités en utilisant un système d''indexation des connaissances basé sur des problèmes méta, en maintenant les invariants et les limites d''agrégat avec des modèles Rust tels que struct + Id pour les entités.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Rust-Entwickler durch Designentscheidungen und Identifizierung von Entitäten zu führen, indem sie ein meta-problemgetriebenes Wissensindexierungssystem verwenden, um Invarianten und Aggregatgrenzen mit Rust-Mustern wie struct + Id für Entitäten aufrechtzuerhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a orientar os desenvolvedores Rust por meio de escolhas de design e identificação de entidades usando um sistema de indexação de conhecimento orientado a problemas, mantendo invariantes e limites agregados com padrões Rust como struct + Id para Entidades.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью направлять разработчиков Rust через выбор дизайна и идентификацию сущностей с помощью системы индексации знаний, ориентированной на метапроблемы, сохраняя инварианты и границы агрегатов с помощью шаблонов Rust, таких как struct + Id для сущностей.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توجيه مطوري رست من خلال خيارات التصميم وتحديد الكيانات باستخدام نظام فهرسة المعرفة القائم على مشكلات ميتا، مع الحفاظ على الثوابت وحدود التجميع باستخدام أنماط رست مثل struct + Id للكيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Modeling entities and value objects in Rust","Identifying aggregate boundaries for efficient code organization","Maintaining invariants in Rust code for robust domain modeling"],"zh":["在Rust中建模实体和值对象","识别聚合边界以实现高效的代码组织","在Rust代码中维护不变量以实现强大的领域建模"],"ja":["Rustにおけるエンティティと値オブジェクトのモデリング","効率的なコード組織のために集約境界を識別する","Rustコード内で不変量を維持して堅牢なドメインモデリングを実現する"],"ko":["Rust에서 엔티티와 값 객체 모델링","효율적인 코드 조직을 위해 집합 경계 식별","Rust 코드에서 불변량 유지하여 강력한 도메인 모델링"],"es":["Modelado de entidades y objetos de valor en Rust","Identificación de límites de agregados para una organización de código eficiente","Mantenimiento de invariantes en el código Rust para un modelado de dominio robusto"],"fr":["Modélisation d''entités et d''objets de valeur en Rust","Identification des limites d''agrégat pour une organisation de code efficace","Maintenance des invariants dans le code Rust pour une modélisation de domaine robuste"],"de":["Modellierung von Entitäten und Wertobjekten in Rust","Identifizierung von Aggregatgrenzen für eine effiziente Codeorganisation","Aufrechterhaltung von Invarianten im Rust-Code für eine robuste Domänenmodellierung"],"pt":["Modelagem de entidades e objetos de valor em Rust","Identificação de limites agregados para organização de código eficiente","Manutenção de invariantes no código Rust para modelagem de domínio robusta"],"ru":["Моделирование сущностей и объектов значения в Rust","Идентификация границ агрегатов для эффективной организации кода","Сохранение инвариантов в коде Rust для надёжной моделирования домена"],"ar":["نمذجة الكيانات وأشياء القيمة في رست","تحديد حدود التجميع من أجل تنظيم الشفرة بكفاءة","الحفاظ على الثوابت في代码 رست من أجل نمذجة نطاق قوية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust development environment","Limited to domain modeling and code optimization in Rust"],"zh":["需要Rust开发环境","仅限于Rust中的领域建模和代码优化"],"ja":["Rust開発環境が必要","Rustにおけるドメインモデリングとコード最適化に限定される"],"ko":["Rust 개발 환경 필요","Rust의 도메인 모델링 및 코드 최적화에 한정"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de Rust","Limitado al modelado de dominio y la optimización de código en Rust"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement Rust","Limité au modélisation de domaine et à l''optimisation de code en Rust"],"de":["Benötigt eine Rust-Entwicklungsumgebung","Begrenzt auf Domänenmodellierung und Codeoptimierung in Rust"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de desenvolvimento Rust","Limitado à modelagem de domínio e otimização de código em Rust"],"ru":["Требуется среда разработки Rust","Ограничен моделью домена и оптимизацией кода в Rust"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير رست","محدود بنمذجة النطاق وتحسين الشفرة في رست"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a05f32b475b01d630d54a38a4b9942499b8ea873bc6d2627144fcd8b85b8b53a","qualityScore":33}');
