INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('analogjs/angular-skills/angular-di', 'angular-di', 'analogjs', 'angular-skills', 'community', 'angular-di analogjs angular-skills community The angular-di skill enables Angular developers to configure and use dependency injection in Angular v20+ with inject() and providers. It benefits developers by simplifying dependency management. Angular DI 是一个用于配置和使用依赖注入的技能，支持 Angular v20+ 中的 inject() 和提供者 Angular DI は、依存性注入を設定および使用するために使用されるスキルで、Angular v20+ の inject() とプロバイダーをサポートします Angular DI는 의존성 주입을 설정하고 사용하기 위한 기술로 Angular v20+의 inject() 및 제공자를 지원합니다 La inyección de dependencias de Angular es una característica clave para la gestión de dependencias en aplicaciones Angular L''injection de dépendances Angular est une fonctionnalité clé pour la gestion des dépendances dans les applications Angular Die Abhängigkeitsinjektion von Angular ist eine wichtige Funktion für die Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten in Angular-Anwendungen Configure e use injeção de dependência no Angular v20+ com inject() e providers Настройка и использование внедрения зависимостей в Angular v20+ с inject() и providers تهيئة واستخدام الحقن التابعية في Angular v20+ مع inject() و providers how to use angular-di angular-di setup guide what is angular-di angular-di vs constructor injection angular-di install angular-di alternative angular dependency injection best practices using inject() in angular-di angular-di providers Angular DI 依赖注入 inject() 提供者 Angular v20+ 依赖关系管理 Angular 组件 HttpClient User 服务 Configures dependency injection in Angular v20+ using inject() Utilizes providers for efficient dependency management Preferably uses inject() over constructor injection Supports HttpClient and User services integration Enables basic injection using the inject() function angular-di is a skill for Angular developers to master dependency injection using inject() and providers in Angular v20+.');
