g in 3 Phasen: Scraping, Identifizierung und Umwandlung"],"pt":["Scraping de sites com Firecrawl MCP","Transformação de sites em código Next.js 16","Suporte a formatos markdown e html","Filtro de seções personalizável","Execução em 3 fases: scrape, processamento e geração de código"],"ru":["Скраппинг сайтов с помощью Firecrawl MCP","Преобразование сайтов в код Next.js 16","Поддержка форматов markdown и html","Настраиваемый фильтр секций","Выполнение в 3 фазах: скраппинг, обработка и генерация кода"],"ar":["استخراج المواقع باستخدام Firecrawl MCP","تحويل المواقع إلى كود Next.js 16","دعم تنسيقات markdown و html","مرشح مقاطع قابل للتخصيص","تنفيذ في 3 مراحل: استخراج، معالجة و إنشاء كود"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use clone-website","what is clone-website","clone-website alternative","clone-website vs Firecrawl","clone-website install","clone-website setup guide","Next.js 16 code generation","Firecrawl MCP tutorial","website cloning with AI agents"],"zh":["clone-website技能","Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","网站转换","快速开发","AI工具","网站开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ウェブサイトクローン","Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","高速開発","ウェブ開発","AIツール"],"ko":["clone-website 스킬","Next.js 16","Firecrawl MCP","웹사이트 변환","빠른 개발","AI 에이전트","웹 개발"],"es":["clonar sitio web","agentes de inteligencia artificial","Firecrawl MCP","Next.js 16","scraping de sitios web","transformación de código","desarrollo web","herramientas de desarrollo","IA para desarrollo web"],"fr":["cloner un site web","agents d''intelligence artificielle","Firecrawl MCP","Next.js 16","scraping de sites web","transformation de code","développement web","outils de développement","IA pour le développement web"],"de":["Website klonen","künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten","Firecrawl MCP","Next.js 16","Scraping von Websites","Code-Umwandlung","Webentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","KI für Webentwicklung"],"pt":["clone-website","Firecrawl MCP","Next.js 16","scraping de sites","transformação de sites","desenvolvimento web","herramientas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["клон сайта","Firecrawl MCP","Next.js 16","скраппинг сайтов","преобразование сайтов","веб-разработка","инструменты разработки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["استنساخ الموقع","Firecrawl MCP","Next.js 16","استخراج المواقع","تحويل المواقع","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"julianromli","repo":"ai-skills","repoPath":"julianromli/ai-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.286Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clone-website","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Clone Website Skill\n\nTransform any website into production-ready Next.js 16 code using Firecrawl MCP.\n\n## Workflow\n\nExecute these 3 phases in order. **Never skip Phase 2.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scrape\n\n1. Extract URL from user request\n2. Identify section filter if specified (e.g., \"hero only\", \"just the pricing\")\n3. Scrape using Firecrawl:\n\n```\nfirecrawl-mcp___firecrawl_scrape:\n  url: [TARGET_URL]\n  formats: [\"markdown\", \"html\"]\n  onlyMainContent: true\n```\n\n4. If scrape fails, fallback to `firecrawl-","body":"# Clone Website Skill\n\nTransform any website into production-ready Next.js 16 code using Firecrawl MCP.\n\n## Workflow\n\nExecute these 3 phases in order. **Never skip Phase 2.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scrape\n\n1. Extract URL from user request\n2. Identify section filter if specified (e.g., \"hero only\", \"just the pricing\")\n3. Scrape using Firecrawl:\n\n```\nfirecrawl-mcp___firecrawl_scrape:\n  url: [TARGET_URL]\n  formats: [\"markdown\", \"html\"]\n  onlyMainContent: true\n```\n\n4. If scrape fails, fallback to `firecrawl-mcp___firecrawl_crawl`\n\n### Phase 2: Analysis (MANDATORY)\n\n**STOP. Present analysis to user before ANY code generation.**\n\nRead [references/analysis-template.md](references/analysis-template.md) and fill out the template with:\n- Detected sections and component breakdown\n- Extracted design tokens (colors, typography, spacing)\n- Image inventory with download/fallback status\n- Proposed file structure\n\nAsk user: \"Ready to proceed? (y/n or request modifications)\"\n\n**Do not generate code until user confirms.**\n\n### Phase 3: Code Generation\n\nAfter user confirmation, generate files in this order:\n\n1. `app/globals.css` - Design tokens as CSS variables\n2. `app/layout.tsx` - Root layout with SEO metadata\n3. `components/landing/[Section].tsx` - Each component\n4. `app/page.tsx` - Main page composing components\n5. Download images to `public/images/`\n\nReference [references/tech-stack.md](references/tech-stack.md) for Next.js 16 conventions.\nReference [references/component-patterns.md](references/component-patterns.md) for component structure.\n\n## Tech Stack (Fixed)\n\n| Layer | Technology |\n|-------|------------|\n| Framework | Next.js 16 (App Router) |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict) |\n| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 |\n| Components | Shadcn UI |\n| Icons | Lucide React |\n| Font | Geist Sans (default) or extracted |\n\n## Image Handling\n\n1. Extract all image URLs from scraped content\n2. Attempt download via fetch\n3. On failure, use Unsplash fallback:\n   - Hero: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-[id]?w=1920&h=1080`\n   - Avatars: `https://images.unsplash.com/photo-[id]?w=100&h=100`\n   - Features: Prefer Lucide icons over images\n4. Save to `public/images/` with descriptive kebab-case names\n\n## Partial Cloning\n\nParse user request for section filters:\n\n| Request | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| \"clone the hero from X\" | Generate only Hero.tsx |\n| \"clone pricing and footer\" | Generate Pricing.tsx + Footer.tsx |\n| \"clone X\" (no filter) | Full page clone |\n\n## Code Standards\n\n- Mobile-first responsive design\n- Use Tailwind arbitrary values for pixel-perfection: `w-[347px]`\n- Extract repeated colors to CSS variables\n- Use `cn()` utility for conditional classes\n- Add brief comments only for non-obvious patterns\n- Prefer `gap-*` over margins for flex/grid spacing\n- Use `size-*` over `w-* h-*` when values match\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:58.569Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing rapid Next.js 16 code generation for website cloning.","zh":"非常适合需要快速为网站克隆生成Next.js 16代码的Web开发代理。","ja":"Web開発エージェントがウェブサイトのクローンを作成するためにNext.js 16コードを迅速に生成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"웹 개발 에이전트가 웹사이트 클로닝을 위해 빠르게 Next.js 16 코드를 생성해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan generación rápida de código Next.js 16 para clonar sitios web.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web ayant besoin d''une génération rapide de code Next.js 16 pour cloner des sites Web.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine schnelle Next.js 16-Codegenerierung für die Website-Klonierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de geração rápida de código Next.js 16 para clonagem de sites.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым требуется быстрая генерация кода Next.js 16 для клонирования сайтов.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل تطوير الويب التي تحتاج إلى توليد سريع للكود Next.js 16 لاستنساخ المواقع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform any website into production-ready Next.js 16 code using Firecrawl MCP, supporting markdown and HTML formats, and providing main content extraction capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理将任何网站转换为生产就绪的Next.js 16代码的能力，使用Firecrawl MCP，支持markdown和HTML格式，并提供主要内容提取能力。","ja":"Firecrawl MCPを使用して、エージェントが任意のウェブサイトを生产就绪のNext.js 16コードに変換できるようにし、MarkdownおよびHTML形式をサポートし、主要コンテンツ抽出機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Firecrawl MCP를 사용하여任意의 웹사이트를 프로덕션 준비가 된 Next.js 16 코드로 변환할 수 있도록 하며, 마크다운 및 HTML 형식을 지원하며 주요 콘텐츠 추출 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar cualquier sitio web en código Next.js 16 listo para producción utilizando Firecrawl MCP, que admite formatos markdown y HTML, y proporciona capacidades de extracción de contenido principal.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer n''importe quel site Web en code Next.js 16 prêt pour la production en utilisant Firecrawl MCP, qui prend en charge les formats markdown et HTML, et fournit des capacités d''extraction de contenu principal.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, jede Website in produktionsbereiten Next.js 16-Code mithilfe von Firecrawl MCP umzuwandeln, das Markdown- und HTML-Formate unterstützt und Funktionen zur Extraktion von Hauptinhalten bietet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar qualquer site em código Next.js 16 pronto para produção usando Firecrawl MCP, suportando formatos markdown e HTML, e fornecendo capacidades de extração de conteúdo principal.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить любой сайт в код Next.js 16, готовый к производству, с помощью Firecrawl MCP, поддерживающий форматы markdown и HTML, и обеспечивающий возможности извлечения основного контента.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل أي موقع إلى كود Next.js 16 جاهز للتشغيل باستخدام Firecrawl MCP ، ودعم تنسيقات markdown و HTML ، وتوفير إمكانيات استخراج المحتوى الرئيسي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating website cloning for rapid prototyping","Generating Next.js 16 code for custom website sections","Scraping website content using Firecrawl MCP for data analysis"],"zh":["用于快速原型开发的网站克隆自动化","为自定义网站部分生成Next.js 16代码","使用Firecrawl MCP进行数据分析的网站内容抓取"],"ja":["迅速なプロトタイピングのためのウェブサイトクローンの自動化","カスタムウェブサイトセクションのNext.js 16コードの生成","Firecrawl MCPを使用したデータ分析のためのウェブサイトコンテンツのスクレイピング"],"ko":["빠른 프로토 타이핑을 위한 웹사이트 클로닝 자동화","사용자 지정 웹사이트 섹션을 위한 Next.js 16 코드 생성","데이터 분석을 위한 Firecrawl MCP를 사용한 웹사이트 콘텐츠 스크레이핑"],"es":["Automatización de la clonación de sitios web para prototipos rápidos","Generación de código Next.js 16 para secciones de sitios web personalizados","Extracción de contenido de sitios web mediante Firecrawl MCP para análisis de datos"],"fr":["Automatisation du clonage de sites Web pour prototypage rapide","Génération de code Next.js 16 pour des sections de sites Web personnalisées","Extraction de contenu de sites Web à l''aide de Firecrawl MCP pour l''analyse de données"],"de":["Automatisierung der Website-Klonierung für schnelles Prototyping","Generierung von Next.js 16-Code für benutzerdefinierte Website-Bereiche","Abruf von Website-Inhalten mithilfe von Firecrawl MCP für Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Automatizar a clonagem de sites para prototipagem rápida","Gerar código Next.js 16 para seções personalizadas de sites","Raspar conteúdo de sites usando Firecrawl MCP para análise de dados"],"ru":["Автоматизация клонирования сайтов для быстрого прототипирования","Генерация кода Next.js 16 для пользовательских разделов сайтов","Скрапинг контента сайтов с помощью Firecrawl MCP для анализа данных"],"ar":["تأتميم استنساخ المواقع للنمذجة السريعة","توليد كود Next.js 16 لأقسام موقع مخصصة","حفر المحتوى من المواقع باستخدام Firecrawl MCP لتحليل البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firecrawl MCP for scraping and code generation","Limited to Next.js 16 code generation","May require fallback to alternative scraping methods if primary method fails"],"zh":["需要Firecrawl MCP进行抓取和代码生成","仅限Next.js 16代码生成","如果主要方法失败，可能需要回退到替代的抓取方法"],"ja":["スクレイピングおよびコード生成のためにFirecrawl MCPが必要","Next.js 16コード生成のみ","プライマリ方法が失敗した場合、代替のスクレイピング方法にフォールバックする必要がある場合があります"],"ko":["스크레이핑 및 코드 생성을 위해 Firecrawl MCP가 필요","Next.js 16 코드 생성만","주要 방법이 실패할 경우 대체스크레이핑 방법으로 돌아갈 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere Firecrawl MCP para scraping y generación de código","Limitado a la generación de código Next.js 16","Puede requerir una fallback a métodos de scraping alternativos si el método principal falla"],"fr":["Nécessite Firecrawl MCP pour le scraping et la génération de code","Limité à la génération de code Next.js 16","Peut nécessiter un recours à des méthodes de scraping alternatives si la méthode principale échoue"],"de":["Benötigt Firecrawl MCP für Scraping und Codegenerierung","Begrenzt auf Next.js 16-Codegenerierung","Kann einen Fallback auf alternative Scraping-Methoden erfordern, wenn die primäre Methode fehlschlägt"],"pt":["Exige Firecrawl MCP para raspagem e geração de código","Limitado à geração de código Next.js 16","Pode exigir fallback para métodos de raspagem alternativos se o método principal falhar"],"ru":["Требует Firecrawl MCP для скрапинга и генерации кода","Ограничен генерацией кода Next.js 16","Может требовать откат к альтернативным методам скрапинга, если основной метод не сработает"],"ar":["يتطلب Firecrawl MCP لاستخراج و توليد الكود","محدود بتوليد كود Next.js 16","يمكن أن يتطلب التراجع إلى أساليب استخراج بديلة إذا فشل الأسلوب الرئيسي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"e2b7858fd339d2c546421ccc021c0543a6cda31731d1535651aed5cffea30cd5","qualityScore":33}');
