INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('julianromli/ai-skills/clone-website', 'clone-website', 'julianromli', 'ai-skills', 'community', 'clone-website julianromli ai-skills community The clone-website skill transforms any website into production-ready Next.js 16 code using Firecrawl MCP, benefiting developers and AI agents alike. clone-website技能能够将任何网站转换为生产就绪的Next.js 16代码，利用Firecrawl MCP实现快速开发 このスキルは、Firecrawl MCPを使用して、任意のウェブサイトをNext.js 16コードに変換します clone-website 스킬은 Firecrawl MCP를 사용하여 웹사이트를 Next.js 16 코드로 변환하는 기능을 제공합니다 Clonar sitio web es una habilidad que transforma cualquier sitio web en código Next.js 16 listo para producción utilizando Firecrawl MCP Cloner un site web est une compétence qui transforme n''importe quel site web en code Next.js 16 prêt pour la production en utilisant Firecrawl MCP Website klonen ist eine Fähigkeit, die jede Website in Next.js 16-Code umwandelt, der für die Produktion bereit ist, mit Firecrawl MCP O clone-website é uma habilidade que transforma sites em código Next.js 16 pronto para produção usando Firecrawl MCP. Клон сайта - это навык, который преобразует сайты в код Next.js 16, готовый к производству, с помощью Firecrawl MCP. استنساخ الموقع هو مهارة تتحول المواقع إلى كود Next.js 16 جاهز للإنتاج باستخدام Firecrawl MCP. how to use clone-website what is clone-website clone-website alternative clone-website vs Firecrawl clone-website install clone-website setup guide Next.js 16 code generation Firecrawl MCP tutorial website cloning with AI agents clone-website技能 Next.js 16 Firecrawl MCP 网站转换 快速开发 AI工具 网站开发 Scrapes websites using Firecrawl with markdown and HTML formats Identifies section filters for targeted scraping, such as ''hero only'' or ''just the pricing'' Executes a 3-phase workflow for website cloning, including scraping and code generation Utilizes Firecrawl MCP for efficient website transformation Falls back to firecrawl- if scraping fails, ensuring a reliable cloning process Generates production-ready Next.js 16 code for seamless integration clone-website is a skill that enables the transformation of any website into production-ready Next.js 16 code using Firecrawl MCP.');
