hir 릴리즈 관리를 위한 AI 도구입니다","es":"Release Manager es una herramienta de gestión de lanzamientos que ayuda a los desarrolladores a verificar, documentar y coordinar lanzamientos de software de manera efectiva","fr":"Release Manager est un outil de gestion de lancements qui aide les développeurs à vérifier, documenter et coordonner les lancements de logiciels de manière efficace","de":"Release Manager ist ein Tool für die Veröffentlichungsverwaltung, das Entwicklern hilft, Software-Veröffentlichungen zu überprüfen, zu dokumentieren und zu koordinieren","pt":"O que é Release Manager? É uma ferramenta que ajuda a gerenciar releases de software de forma eficiente","ru":"Что такое Release Manager? Это инструмент, помогающий управлять релизами программного обеспечения эффективно","ar":"ما هي إدارة الإصدار؟ هي أداة تساعد في إدارة إصدارات البرمجيات بفعالية"},"features":{"en":["Runs pre-release verification checks to ensure release quality","Generates and reviews changelogs for accurate release documentation","Coordinates version bumps to maintain consistent versioning","Manages the release workflow to reduce manual errors and increase efficiency"],"zh":["预发布验证","变更日志管理","版本管理","发布工作流管理"],"ja":["事前リリース検証","変更ログ管理","バージョン管理","リリースワークフローの管理"],"ko":["事前 릴리즈 검증","변경 로그 관리","버전 관리","릴리즈 워크플로우 관리"],"es":["Verificación previa al lanzamiento","Gestión de changelogs","Gestión de versiones","Coordinación de lanzamientos"],"fr":["Vérification préalable au lancement","Gestion des changelogs","Gestion des versions","Coordination des lancements"],"de":["Überprüfung vor der Veröffentlichung","Changelog-Verwaltung","Versionsverwaltung","Veröffentlichungskoordinierung"],"pt":["Verificação prévia de releases","Gerenciamento de changelogs","Controle de versões","Coordenação de releases"],"ru":["Предварительная проверка релизов","Управление changelogs","Контроль версий","Координация релизов"],"ar":["التحقق من الإصدارات قبل الإصدار","إدارة سجلات التغيير","مراقبة الإصدارات","تنسيق الإصدارات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use release-manager","release-manager setup guide","release-manager alternative","release-manager vs morphir","automated release workflow","morphir release management"],"zh":["Release Manager","Morphir发布管理","AI工具","预发布验证","变更日志管理","版本管理","发布工作流管理"],"ja":["Release Manager","Morphirリリース管理","AIエージェント","事前リリース検証","変更ログ管理","バージョン管理","リリースワークフローの管理"],"ko":["Release Manager","Morphir 릴리즈 관리","AI 도구","事前 릴리즈 검증","변경 로그 관리","버전 관리","릴리즈 워크플로우 관리"],"es":["Release Manager","gestión de lanzamientos","verificación previa al lanzamiento","gestión de changelogs","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","Agente de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Release Manager","gestion de lancements","vérification préalable au lancement","gestion des changelogs","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","Outil d''intelligence artificielle pour développeurs"],"de":["Release Manager","Veröffentlichungsverwaltung","Überprüfung vor der Veröffentlichung","Changelog-Verwaltung","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Künstliche Intelligenz-Tool für Entwickler"],"pt":["Release Manager","gerenciamento de releases","verificação prévia","changelogs","controle de versões","coordenação de releases","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","otimização de releases"],"ru":["Release Manager","управление релизами","предварительная проверка","changelogs","контроль версий","координация релизов","инструменты разработки","оптимизация релизов","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["إدارة الإصدار","إدارة الإصدارات","التحقق من الإصدارات","سجلات التغيير","مراقبة الإصدارات","تنسيق الإصدارات","أدوات التطوير","تحسين الإصدارات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"finos","repo":"morphir","repoPath":"finos/morphir","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.295Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-manager","description":"Assists with Morphir release management, including pre-release verification, changelog generation, and release coordination. Use when preparing releases, checking release readiness, or managing version bumps.","bodyPreview":"# Release Manager Skill\n\nYou are a release management assistant specialized in Morphir releases. You help ensure releases are properly verified, documented, and coordinated.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n1. **Pre-Release Verification** - Run all checks before releasing\n2. **Changelog Management** - Generate and review changelogs\n3. **Version Management** - Coordinate version bumps\n4. **Release Coordination** - Manage the release workflow\n\n## Pre-Release Verification Checklist\n\nBefore any release, run the fo","body":"# Release Manager Skill\n\nYou are a release management assistant specialized in Morphir releases. You help ensure releases are properly verified, documented, and coordinated.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n1. **Pre-Release Verification** - Run all checks before releasing\n2. **Changelog Management** - Generate and review changelogs\n3. **Version Management** - Coordinate version bumps\n4. **Release Coordination** - Manage the release workflow\n\n## Pre-Release Verification Checklist\n\nBefore any release, run the following verification steps:\n\n### Automated Checks\n\n```bash\n# 1. Run all formatting checks\nmise run fmt-check\n\n# 2. Run all linters\nmise run lint\n\n# 3. Run all tests\nmise run test\n\n# 4. Validate schemas against metaschema\nmise run schema:validate\n\n# 5. Validate documentation examples\nmise run examples:validate\n\n# 6. Validate fixtures\nmise run fixtures:validate\n\n# 7. Verify schema sync (YAML/JSON)\nmise run docs:schema:verify\n\n# 8. Full check pipeline (runs all of the above)\nmise run check\n```\n\n### Manual Verification\n\n- [ ] CHANGELOG.md is updated with all notable changes\n- [ ] Version numbers are consistent across all files\n- [ ] Breaking changes are documented with migration guides\n- [ ] All CI pipelines are green\n- [ ] Documentation site builds successfully\n\n## Release Workflow\n\n### 1. Prepare Release\n\n```bash\n# Ensure all checks pass\nmise run check\n\n# Generate changelog (if using git-cliff)\ngit cliff --unreleased --tag vX.Y.Z > CHANGELOG-next.md\n\n# Review and merge changelog\n```\n\n### 2. Create Release\n\n```bash\n# Create release branch (if applicable)\ngit checkout -b release/vX.Y.Z\n\n# Update version numbers\n# - Cargo.toml\n# - package.json (if applicable)\n# - Any other version files\n\n# Commit version bump\ngit commit -am \"chore: bump version to X.Y.Z\"\n\n# Create tag\ngit tag -a vX.Y.Z -m \"Release vX.Y.Z\"\n\n# Push\ngit push origin release/vX.Y.Z --tags\n```\n\n### 3. Post-Release\n\n- [ ] Verify GitHub release is created\n- [ ] Verify documentation site is updated\n- [ ] Verify npm/cargo packages are published (if applicable)\n- [ ] Announce release in appropriate channels\n\n## CI Integration\n\nThe following checks should be part of CI and must pass before release:\n\n| Check | Task | Required |\n|-------|------|----------|\n| Formatting | `mise run fmt-check` | ✓ |\n| Linting | `mise run lint` | ✓ |\n| Tests | `mise run test` | ✓ |\n| Schema validation | `mise run schema:validate` | ✓ |\n| Example validation | `mise run examples:validate` | ✓ |\n| Fixture validation | `mise run fixtures:validate` | ✓ |\n| Schema sync | `mise run docs:schema:verify` | ✓ |\n\n## Task Reference\n\n| Task | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `mise run check` | Run all checks (formatting, linting, validation) |\n| `mise run fmt` | Format all code |\n| `mise run fmt:rust` | Format Rust code only |\n| `mise run fmt:schema` | Format JSON Schema files only |\n| `mise run lint` | Run all linters |\n| `mise run lint:rust` | Run Clippy only |\n| `mise run lint:schema` | Lint JSON Schema files only |\n| `mise run test` | Run all tests |\n| `mise run schema:validate` | Validate schemas against metaschema |\n| `mise run examples:validate` | Validate doc examples against schemas |\n| `mise run fixtures:validate` | Validate fixture files against schemas |\n| `mise run docs:schema:verify` | Verify YAML/JSON schema sync |\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Schema Validation Failures\n\nIf `schema:validate` fails:\n1. Check the specific error message\n2. Validate the schema file syntax\n3. Ensure the schema follows JSON Schema draft-07/2019-09/2020-12 as appropriate\n\n### Example Validation Failures\n\nIf `examples:validate` fails:\n1. Check which files failed with `mise run examples:validate --verbose`\n2. Ensure `formatVersion` field is present in example files\n3. Verify examples match the schema for their version\n\n### Fixture Validation Failures\n\nIf `fixtures:validate` fails:\n1. Fixtures may need to be refetched: `mise run fixtures:fetch`\n2. Check if fixtures are valid Morphir IR format\n3. Ensure fixtures are in the expected locations:\n   - `.morphir/testing/fixtures/`\n   - `tests/bdd/testdata/morphir-ir/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:11.817Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined Morphir release management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简化Morphir发布管理功能的开发代理。","ja":"Morphirのリリース管理機能をストリームライン化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Morphir 릴리스 관리 기능을 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de administración de versiones de Morphir optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de version Morphir rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die optimierte Morphir-Release-Managementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de lançamento do Morphir otimizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы оптимизированные возможности управления выпусками Morphir.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموذجيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إدارة الإصدارات المُبسطة من Morphir."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate pre-release verification, manage changelogs, and coordinate version bumps using Morphir releases, reducing manual errors and increasing efficiency through automated workflows and version control.","zh":"赋予代理自动化预发布验证、管理更改日志和使用Morphir发布协调版本更新的能力，通过自动化工作流和版本控制减少手动错误并提高效率。","ja":"エージェントに、Morphirのリリースを使用して事前リリースの検証を自動化し、変更ログを管理し、バージョンの更新を調整する能力を与え、自動化されたワークフローとバージョン管理により手動エラーを減らし、効率を高めます。","ko":"에이전트에게 Morphir 릴리스를 사용하여 事前 릴리스 검증을 자동화하고, 변경 로그를 관리하고, 버전 업데이트를 조정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 자동화된 워크플로우와 버전 관리를 통해 수동 오류를 줄이고 효율성을 높입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la verificación previa al lanzamiento, administrar registros de cambios y coordinar incrementos de versión utilizando lanzamientos de Morphir, reduciendo errores manuales y aumentando la eficiencia a través de flujos de trabajo automatizados y control de versiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la vérification préalable au lancement, de gérer les journaux des modifications et de coordonner les mises à jour de version à l''aide des versions Morphir, en réduisant les erreurs manuelles et en augmentant l''efficacité grâce aux flux de travail automatisés et au contrôle de version.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Überprüfung vor der Veröffentlichung zu automatisieren, Änderungsprotokolle zu verwalten und Versionsaktualisierungen mithilfe von Morphir-Veröffentlichungen zu koordinieren, wodurch manuelle Fehler reduziert und die Effizienz durch automatisierte Arbeitsabläufe und Versionskontrolle erhöht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a verificação pré-lançamento, gerenciar registros de alterações e coordenar aumentos de versão usando lançamentos do Morphir, reduzindo erros manuais e aumentando a eficiência por meio de fluxos de trabalho automatizados e controle de versão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать проверку перед выпуском, управлять журналами изменений и координировать обновления версий с помощью выпусков Morphir, сокращая ручные ошибки и увеличивая эффективность за счет автоматизированных рабочих процессов и контроля версий.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير التأكد من صحة ما قبل الإصدار، وإدارة سجلات التغييرات، وتنسيق تحديثات الإصدار باستخدام إصدارات Morphir، مما يقلل من الأخطاء اليدوية ويزيد من الكفاءة من خلال سير عمل تلقائية ومراقبة الإصدار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-release checks for Morphir projects","Generating and reviewing changelogs for version updates","Coordinating release workflows for development teams"],"zh":["为Morphir项目自动执行预发布检查","为版本更新生成和审查更改日志","为开发团队协调发布工作流"],"ja":["Morphirプロジェクトの事前リリースチェックを自動化する","バージョン更新のための変更ログを生成してレビューする","開発チームのためのリリースワークフローを調整する"],"ko":["Morphir 프로젝트의 事前 릴리스 검증을 자동화하는こと","버전 업데이트를 위한 변경 로그를 생성하고 검토하는こと","개발 팀을 위한 릴리스 워크플로우를 조정하는こと"],"es":["Automatizar controles previos al lanzamiento para proyectos Morphir","Generar y revisar registros de cambios para actualizaciones de versión","Coordinar flujos de trabajo de lanzamiento para equipos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications préalables au lancement pour les projets Morphir","Générer et examiner les journaux des modifications pour les mises à jour de version","Coordonner les flux de travail de lancement pour les équipes de développement"],"de":["Automatisieren von Vorkontrollen vor der Veröffentlichung für Morphir-Projekte","Erstellen und Überprüfen von Änderungsprotokollen für Versionsaktualisierungen","Koordinieren von Release-Arbeitsabläufen für Entwicklungsteams"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações pré-lançamento para projetos Morphir","Gerar e revisar registros de alterações para atualizações de versão","Coordenar fluxos de trabalho de lançamento para equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку перед выпуском для проектов Morphir","Генерировать и просматривать журналы изменений для обновлений версий","Координировать рабочие процессы выпуска для команд разработки"],"ar":["توفير التأكد من صحة ما قبل الإصدار للأعمال المنجزة في Morphir","إنتاج وتحديث سجلات التغييرات لتحديثات الإصدار","تنسيق سير عمل الإصدار لفريق التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Morphir project setup","Limited to Morphir releases only"],"zh":["需要Morphir项目设置","仅限Morphir发布"],"ja":["Morphirプロジェクトの設定が必要","Morphirのリリースのみに限定"],"ko":["Morphir 프로젝트 설정이 필요함","Morphir 릴리스만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto Morphir","Limitado a lanzamientos de Morphir solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Morphir","Limité aux versions Morphir uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Morphir-Projektkonfiguration","Begrenzt auf Morphir-Veröffentlichungen nur"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto Morphir","Limitado apenas a lançamentos do Morphir"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Morphir","Ограничен только выпусками Morphir"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Morphir","محدود بالإصدارات Morphir فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"26039204c1d9fcf8fdc79e64ca92c93ce16a1164d27ecc006b66c029f21153e5","qualityScore":33}');
