INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('marcglasberg/async_redux/asyncredux-persistence', 'asyncredux-persistence', 'marcglasberg', 'async_redux', 'community', 'asyncredux-persistence marcglasberg async_redux community asyncredux-persistence provides state management for Flutter, enabling app state restoration between sessions. It benefits developers by maintaining state on disk using a persistor object. AsyncRedux 提供了强大的状态管理功能，通过持久化实现应用状态的保存和恢复 AsyncRedux は強力な状態管理機能を提供し、永続化によりアプリ状態を保存および復元します AsyncRedux는 강력한 상태 관리 기능을 제공하며 지속화 통해 애플리케이션 상태를 저장 및 복원합니다 Asyncredux-persistence proporciona gestión de estado persistente para Flutter, manteniendo el estado de la aplicación en disco Asyncredux-persistence offre une gestion d''état persistante pour Flutter, en conservant l''état de l''application sur disque Asyncredux-persistence bietet persistente Zustandverwaltung für Flutter, indem der Anwendungsstatus auf der Festplatte gespeichert wird O asyncredux-persistence é uma ferramenta poderosa para gerenciamento de estado em Flutter, permitindo a persistência de dados entre sessões. asyncredux-persistence - это мощный инструмент для управления состоянием в Flutter, обеспечивающий сохранение данных между сессиями. asyncredux-persistence هو أداة قوية لإدارة الحالة في تطبيقات Flutter، مما يسمح بالاستمرارية بين الجلسات. how to use asyncredux-persistence asyncredux-persistence setup guide asyncredux-persistence vs flutter_redux asyncredux-persistence install what is asyncredux-persistence asyncredux-persistence documentation asyncredux-persistence example asyncredux-persistence flutter asyncredux-persistence state management AsyncRedux 持久化 Flutter 状态管理 持久化设置指南 AsyncRedux 教程 Flutter 应用开发 状态管理最佳实践 Initializes the store with a persistor object to maintain app state on disk Restores app state between sessions using the persistor object Creates default state if none exists on disk Reads existing state from disk using the readState method Supports state persistence using a custom persistor object asyncredux-persistence is a state management solution for Flutter that maintains app state on disk, enabling restoration between sessions using a persistor object.');
