on cyntec: Décodage du code MPN","de":"cyntec-Konfigurationsleitfaden: MPN-Struktur entschlüsseln","pt":"Guia de Configuração Cyntec: Decodificando MPNs","ru":"ИИ Агент Cyntec: Руководство по Настройке","ar":"دليل ضبط Cyntec: فك شفرة MPNs"},"description":{"en":"Unlock the secrets of cyntec''s MPN structure. Learn how to decode and utilize cyntec''s unique part numbering system for efficient component selection and man...","zh":"了解 Cyntec 的 MPN 结构并掌握其应用，提升您的开发效率","ja":"Cyntec AIエージェントのMPN構造を解析し、開発効率を向上させます","ko":"Cyntec의 MPN 구조를 파악하고 적용하여 개발 효율성을 높이세요","es":"Aprende a decodificar el código MPN de cyntec y descubre cómo funciona la estructura de los números de parte","fr":"Découvrez comment décoder le code MPN de cyntec et comprendre la structure des numéros de pièce","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie den MPN-Code von cyntec entschlüsseln und die Struktur der Teilenummern verstehen","pt":"Aprenda a decodificar os MPNs da Cyntec Corporation e entenda a estrutura de seus produtos","ru":"Изучите структуру MPN корпорации Cyntec и научитесь расшифровывать их продукты","ar":"تعلم كيفية فك شفرة MPNs لشركة Cyntec Corporation وافهم بنية منتجاتها"},"definition":{"en":"cyntec is a manufacturer skill that provides a standardized structure for decoding and utilizing cyntec''s MPN, enabling efficient component selection and management.","zh":"Cyntec 是一种电子元件制造商，其 MPN 结构提供了产品的详细信息","ja":"Cyntec は電子部品メーカーであり、MPN 構造は製品の詳細情報を提供します","ko":"Cyntec은 전자 부품 제조업체로, MPN 구조는 제품의 상세 정보를 제공합니다","es":"cyntec es un fabricante que utiliza una estructura de MPN para identificar sus productos","fr":"cyntec est un fabricant qui utilise une structure de code MPN pour identifier ses produits","de":"cyntec ist ein Hersteller, der eine MPN-Struktur zur Identifizierung seiner Produkte verwendet","pt":"Cyntec é uma habilidade que decodifica os MPNs da Cyntec Corporation","ru":"Cyntec - это навык, который расшифровывает MPN корпорации Cyntec","ar":"Cyntec هو مهارة يفك شفرة MPNs لشركة Cyntec Corporation"},"features":{"en":["Decodes cyntec MPNs using a structured format: [SERIES][SIZE][TYPE]-[VALUE][TOLERANCE][PACK]","Supports packaging type identification (N=Tape/Reel)","Provides tolerance code identification (M=20%, K=10%)","Enables inductance code extraction","Allows type variant identification (T, S, etc.)"],"zh":["支持 MPN 结构解析","提供产品系列、尺寸、类型等信息","兼容多种开发环境","易于集成和使用","提高开发效率"],"ja":["MPN 構造解析をサポート","製品シリーズ、サイズ、タイプなどの情報を提供","多くの開発環境に対応","簡単に統合して使用可能","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["MPN 구조 해석 지원","제품 시리즈, 크기, 유형 등 정보 제공","다양한 개발 환경 지원","쉽게 통합하여 사용 가능","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Estructura de MPN única","Código de indutancia","Variante de tipo (T, S, etc.)","Código de tamaño de 3-4 dígitos","Empaquetado (N=Tape/Reel)"],"fr":["Structure de code MPN unique","Code d''inductance","Variante de type (T, S, etc.)","Code de taille de 3-4 chiffres","Emballage (N=Tape/Reel)"],"de":["Einzigartige MPN-Struktur","Induktivitätscode","Typvariant (T, S, etc.)","3-4-stelliger Größencode","Verpackung (N=Tape/Reel)"],"pt":["Decodificação de MPNs da Cyntec Corporation","Entendimento da estrutura de produtos da Cyntec","Suporte a série PCMC, VCMD, MCPA e CMC","Análise de código de indutância","Identificação de variantes de tipo (T, S, etc.)","Análise de código de tamanho de 3-4 dígitos"],"ru":["Расшифровка MPN корпорации Cyntec","Понимание структуры продуктов Cyntec","Поддержка серий PCMC, VCMD, MCPA и CMC","Анализ кода индуктивности","Идентификация вариантов типа (T, S и т. д.)","Анализ 3-4-х значного кода размера"],"ar":["فك شفرة MPNs لشركة Cyntec Corporation","فهم بنية منتجات Cyntec","دعم السلاسل PCMC و VCMD و MCPA و CMC","تحليل رمز الحث","تحديد متغيرات النوع (T و S و غيرها)","تحليل رمز الحجم من 3-4 أرقام"]},"keywords":{"en":["cyntec MPN structure","how to decode cyntec MPN","cyntec component selection","cyntec alternative","cyntec vs competitor","cyntec setup guide","what is cyntec","cyntec install","cyntec tutorial"],"zh":["Cyntec","MPN 结构","电子元件","开发指南","MPN 解析","产品信息","开发效率"],"ja":["Cyntec","MPN 構造","電子部品","開発ガイド","MPN 解析","製品情報","開発効率"],"ko":["Cyntec","MPN 구조","전자 부품","개발 문서","MPN 해석","제품 정보","개발 효율성"],"es":["cyntec","MPN","estructura de MPN","código de indutancia","variante de tipo","código de tamaño","empaquetado","herramientas de AI","agentes de AI"],"fr":["cyntec","MPN","structure de code MPN","code d''inductance","variante de type","code de taille","emballage","outils d''IA","agents d''IA"],"de":["cyntec","MPN","MPN-Struktur","Induktivitätscode","Typvariant","Größencode","Verpackung","KI-Tools","KI-Agents"],"pt":["cyntec","mpn","decodificação de mpn","cyntec corporation","produto cyntec","serie pcmc","serie vcmd","serie mcpc","serie cmc"],"ru":["cyntec","mpn","расшифровка mpn","корпорация cyntec","продукт cyntec","серия pcmc","серия vcmd","серия mcpc","серия cmc"],"ar":["cyntec","mpn","فك شفرة mpn","شركة cyntec","منتج cyntec","سلسلة pcmc","سلسلة vcmd","سلسلة mcpc","سلسلة cmc"]}},"owner":"Cantara","repo":"lib-electronic-components","repoPath":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.297Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cyntec","description":"Cyntec power inductor MPN encoding patterns, value decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with Cyntec inductors or CyntecHandler.","bodyPreview":"# Cyntec Corporation Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nCyntec MPNs follow this structure:\n\n```\n[SERIES][SIZE][TYPE]-[VALUE][TOLERANCE][PACK]\n   |      |     |      |        |        |\n   |      |     |      |        |        +-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n   |      |     |      |        +-- M=20%, K=10%\n   |      |     |      +-- Inductance code\n   |      |     +-- Type variant (T, S, etc.)\n   |      +-- 3-4 digit size code\n   +-- Series (PCMC, VCMD, MCPA, CMC)\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nPC","body":"# Cyntec Corporation Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nCyntec MPNs follow this structure:\n\n```\n[SERIES][SIZE][TYPE]-[VALUE][TOLERANCE][PACK]\n   |      |     |      |        |        |\n   |      |     |      |        |        +-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n   |      |     |      |        +-- M=20%, K=10%\n   |      |     |      +-- Inductance code\n   |      |     +-- Type variant (T, S, etc.)\n   |      +-- 3-4 digit size code\n   +-- Series (PCMC, VCMD, MCPA, CMC)\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nPCMC063T-1R0MN\n|   |  |  |  ||\n|   |  |  |  |+-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n|   |  |  |  +-- Tolerance (M=+/-20%)\n|   |  |  +-- Inductance (1R0 = 1.0uH)\n|   |  +-- Type variant (T)\n|   +-- Size (063 = 6.3mm)\n+-- PCMC = Power Inductor series\n\nMCPA0504-1R0MN\n|   |    |  ||\n|   |    |  |+-- Packaging (N=Tape/Reel)\n|   |    |  +-- Tolerance (M=+/-20%)\n|   |    +-- Inductance (1R0 = 1.0uH)\n|   +-- Size (0504 = 5.0mm x 4.0mm)\n+-- MCPA = Automotive Power Inductor series\n\nCMC0503-471M\n|  |    |  |\n|  |    |  +-- Tolerance (M=+/-20%)\n|  |    +-- Impedance (471 = 470 ohm)\n|  +-- Size (0503 = 5.0mm x 3.0mm)\n+-- CMC = Common Mode Choke series\n```\n\n---\n\n## Series Reference\n\n### PCMC - Power Inductors\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Power inductor |\n| Pattern | `^PCMC[0-9]{3,4}.*` |\n| Size format | 3-4 digits |\n| Application | General power conversion |\n\n### VCMD - Molded Power Inductors\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Molded power inductor |\n| Pattern | `^VCMD[0-9]{3,4}.*` |\n| Size format | 3-4 digits |\n| Application | High current, shielded |\n\n### MCPA - Automotive Power Inductors\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Automotive-grade power inductor |\n| Pattern | `^MCPA[0-9]{4}.*` |\n| Size format | 4 digits |\n| Application | AEC-Q200 qualified |\n\n### CMC - Common Mode Chokes\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Type | Common mode choke |\n| Pattern | `^CMC[0-9]{4}.*` |\n| Size format | 4 digits |\n| Application | EMI/EMC filtering |\n\n---\n\n## Inductance Encoding\n\nCyntec uses standard R-notation:\n\n### R-Notation (Decimal Point)\n\n| Code | Value | Notes |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| R47 | 0.47uH | R at start = sub-1uH |\n| R68 | 0.68uH | R at start |\n| 1R0 | 1.0uH | R in middle |\n| 2R2 | 2.2uH | R in middle |\n| 4R7 | 4.7uH | R in middle |\n| 6R8 | 6.8uH | R in middle |\n\n### 3-Digit Multiplier Code\n\n| Code | Value | Calculation |\n|------|-------|-------------|\n| 100 | 10uH | 10 x 10^0 |\n| 101 | 100uH | 10 x 10^1 |\n| 220 | 22uH | 22 x 10^0 |\n| 470 | 47uH | 47 x 10^0 |\n| 471 | 470uH | 47 x 10^1 |\n\n### Decoding Algorithm\n\n```java\n// R at start (R47, R68)\nif (code.startsWith(\"R\")) {\n    double value = Double.parseDouble(\"0.\" + code.substring(1));\n    return formatInductance(value);\n}\n\n// R in middle (1R0, 2R2)\nif (code.contains(\"R\")) {\n    String[] parts = code.split(\"R\");\n    double value = Double.parseDouble(parts[0] + \".\" + parts[1]);\n    return formatInductance(value);\n}\n\n// 3-digit code\nif (code.matches(\"\\\\d{3}\")) {\n    int mantissa = Integer.parseInt(code.substring(0, 2));\n    int exponent = Integer.parseInt(code.substring(2, 3));\n    double microhenries = mantissa * Math.pow(10, exponent);\n    return formatInductance(microhenries);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Size Code Formats\n\n### 3-Digit Size (PCMC, VCMD)\n\n| Code | Dimension |\n|------|-----------|\n| 063 | 6.3mm |\n| 050 | 5.0mm |\n| 040 | 4.0mm |\n\n### 4-Digit Size (MCPA, CMC)\n\n| Code | Dimensions |\n|------|------------|\n| 0504 | 5.0mm x 4.0mm |\n| 0403 | 4.0mm x 3.0mm |\n| 0503 | 5.0mm x 3.0mm |\n\n---\n\n## Tolerance Codes\n\n| Code | Tolerance |\n|------|-----------|\n| K | +/- 10% |\n| M | +/- 20% |\n\n---\n\n## Package Type by Series\n\n| Series | Package Type |\n|--------|--------------|\n| PCMC | Power Inductor |\n| VCMD | Molded Power Inductor |\n| MCPA | Automotive Power Inductor |\n| CMC | Common Mode Choke |\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### Series Extraction\n\n```java\n// Returns series + size + type as the full identifier\n// PCMC063T-1R0MN -> \"PCMC063T\"\n// MCPA0504-1R0MN -> \"MCPA0504\"\n\nMatcher m = PCMC_PATTERN.matcher(upperMpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String type = m.group(3);\n    return m.group(1) + m.group(2) + (type != null ? type : \"\");\n}\n\nm = VCMD_PATTERN.matcher(upperMpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String type = m.group(3);\n    return m.group(1) + m.group(2) + (type != null ? type : \"\");\n}\n\n// MCPA and CMC don''t have type suffix\nm = MCPA_PATTERN.matcher(upperMpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    return m.group(1) + m.group(2);\n}\n```\n\n### Package Code Extraction\n\n```java\n// Returns the package type description based on series\nString series = extractSeriesPrefix(mpn);\nreturn SERIES_PACKAGE_MAP.get(series);\n// Returns: \"Power Inductor\", \"Molded Power Inductor\", etc.\n```\n\n### Value Extraction\n\n```java\n// Value code position varies by series\n// PCMC/VCMD: group(4) after type\n// MCPA/CMC: group(3) directly after size\n\nMatcher m = PCMC_PATTERN.matcher(mpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String valueCode = m.group(4);\n    return parseInductanceCode(valueCode);\n}\n\nm = MCPA_PATTERN.matcher(mpn);\nif (m.matches()) {\n    String valueCode = m.group(3);\n    return parseInductanceCode(valueCode);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pattern Details\n\n### PCMC Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(PCMC)(\\\\d{3,4})([A-Z]?)[-]?([0-9R]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// Groups: (1)series (2)size (3)type (4)value (5)tolerance+options\n```\n\n### VCMD Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(VCMD)(\\\\d{3,4})([A-Z]?)[-]?([0-9R]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// Same structure as PCMC\n```\n\n### MCPA Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(MCPA)(\\\\d{4})[-]?([0-9R]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// No type field, 4-digit size only\n```\n\n### CMC Pattern\n\n```java\nPattern.compile(\n    \"^(CMC)(\\\\d{4})[-]?([0-9]+)([A-Z]*)$\"\n);\n// Numeric-only value (impedance), no R-notation\n```\n\n---\n\n## Component Types\n\nCyntec products map to:\n- `INDUCTOR` - All inductor and choke products\n- `IC` - Also registered for pattern matching compatibility\n\n---\n\n## CMC Impedance Encoding\n\nCommon mode chokes use 3-digit impedance code (like ferrite beads):\n\n| Code | Impedance |\n|------|-----------|\n| 471 | 470 ohm |\n| 102 | 1000 ohm |\n| 222 | 2200 ohm |\n\n---\n\n## Common Part Numbers\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| PCMC063T-1R0MN | 1.0uH power inductor, 6.3mm |\n| VCMD063T-2R2MN | 2.2uH molded inductor, 6.3mm |\n| MCPA0504-1R0MN | 1.0uH automotive inductor |\n| CMC0503-471M | 470 ohm common mode choke |\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/CyntecHandler.java`\n- Supported types: `INDUCTOR`, `IC`\n- No manufacturer-specific ComponentType enum entries\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n- **Variable size digit count**: PCMC/VCMD can have 3 OR 4 digit size codes (063 vs 0504). MCPA/CMC always have 4.\n- **Type field presence**: PCMC/VCMD have optional type letter (T, S). MCPA/CMC don''t have this field.\n- **CMC uses impedance**: Common mode chokes encode impedance, not inductance. No R-notation allowed.\n- **Series included in package code**: Unlike other handlers, Cyntec returns the package TYPE name (e.g., \"Power Inductor\") not size.\n- **Dash is optional**: The dash before value code may be present or absent.\n- **N suffix = tape and reel**: Standard packaging suffix.\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:16.826Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Electronics Agents needing to decipher cyntec''s MPN structure for efficient component selection and management.","zh":"非常适合需要解析cyntec的MPN结构以实现高效元件选择和管理的电子代理商。","ja":"ElectronicsエージェントがcyntecのMPN構造を解読して効率的なコンポーネントの選択と管理を行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"전자 에이전트가 cyntec의 MPN 구조를 해석하여 효율적인 구성 요소 선택 및 관리를 수행해야 하는 경우에 이상적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de electrónica que necesitan descifrar la estructura de MPN de cyntec para una selección y gestión de componentes eficientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents électroniques qui doivent déchiffrer la structure MPN de cyntec pour une sélection et une gestion de composants efficaces.","de":"Perfekt für Elektronikagenten, die die MPN-Struktur von cyntec entschlüsseln müssen, um eine effiziente Komponentenauswahl und -verwaltung zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Eletrônica que precisam decifrar a estrutura de MPN da cyntec para seleção e gerenciamento eficientes de componentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электроники, которым необходимо расшифровать структуру MPN cyntec для эффективного выбора и управления компонентами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإلكترونيات الذي يحتاج إلى فك تشفير هيكل MPN لشركة cyntec من أجل اختيار و إدارة المكونات بفعالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to decode cyntec MPNs, facilitating the extraction of crucial information such as series, size, type, inductance code, tolerance, and packaging, using the MPN structure to optimize component selection and management.","zh":"赋予代理商解码cyntec MPN的能力，方便提取系列、尺寸、类型、电感代码、公差和包装等关键信息，并使用MPN结构优化元件选择和管理。","ja":"エージェントがcyntec MPNを解読できるようにし、シリーズ、サイズ、タイプ、インダクタンスコード、公差、パッケージなどの重要な情報を抽出することを容易にし、MPN構造を使用してコンポーネントの選択と管理を最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 cyntec MPN을 해석할 수 있도록 하여 시리즈, 크기, 유형, 인덕턴스 코드, 허용 오차 및 패키징과 같은 중요한 정보를 추출하는 것을容易하게 하며, MPN 구조를 사용하여 구성 요소 선택 및 관리를 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a decodificar los MPNs de cyntec, facilitando la extracción de información crucial como serie, tamaño, tipo, código de inductancia, tolerancia y embalaje, utilizando la estructura de MPN para optimizar la selección y gestión de componentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déchiffrer les MPNs de cyntec, facilitant l''extraction d''informations cruciales telles que la série, la taille, le type, le code d''inductance, la tolérance et l''emballage, en utilisant la structure MPN pour optimiser la sélection et la gestion de composants.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die MPNs von cyntec zu entschlüsseln, wodurch die Extraktion von wichtigen Informationen wie Serie, Größe, Typ, Induktivitätscode, Toleranz und Verpackung erleichtert wird, indem die MPN-Struktur zur Optimierung der Komponentenauswahl und -verwaltung verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a decodificar os MPNs da cyntec, facilitando a extração de informações cruciais, como série, tamanho, tipo, código de indutância, tolerância e embalagem, utilizando a estrutura do MPN para otimizar a seleção e o gerenciamento de componentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расшифровать MPN cyntec, облегчая извлечение важной информации, такой как серия, размер, тип, код индуктивности, допуск и упаковка, используя структуру MPN для оптимизации выбора и управления компонентами.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية فك تشفير MPN لشركة cyntec، و تسهل استخراج المعلومات الحيوية مثل السلسلة، والحجم، والنوع، ورمز الحث، والتسامح، والتعبئة، باستخدام هيكل MPN لتحسين اختيار المكونات وإدارتها."},"useCases":{"en":["Decoding cyntec MPNs for component identification","Automating cyntec component selection based on specific MPN parameters","Generating reports on cyntec component inventory using MPN structure"],"zh":["解码cyntec MPN以识别元件","根据特定MPN参数自动执行cyntec元件选择","使用MPN结构生成cyntec元件库存报告"],"ja":["コンポーネントの識別のためにcyntec MPNを解読する","特定のMPNパラメータに基づいてcyntecコンポーネントの選択を自動化する","MPN構造を使用してcyntecコンポーネントの在庫レポートを生成する"],"ko":["구성 요소 식별을 위해 cyntec MPN을 해석한다.","특정 MPN 매개 변수를 기준으로 cyntec 구성 요소를 자동으로 선택한다.","MPN 구조를 사용하여 cyntec 구성 요소 재고 보고서를 생성한다."],"es":["Decodificación de MPNs de cyntec para la identificación de componentes","Automatización de la selección de componentes de cyntec en función de parámetros de MPN específicos","Generación de informes sobre el inventario de componentes de cyntec utilizando la estructura de MPN"],"fr":["Déchiffrage des MPNs de cyntec pour l''identification de composants","Automatisation de la sélection de composants cyntec en fonction de paramètres MPN spécifiques","Génération de rapports sur l''inventaire de composants cyntec en utilisant la structure MPN"],"de":["Entschlüsselung von cyntec-MPNs für die Komponentenidentifizierung","Automatisierung der Auswahl von cyntec-Komponenten basierend auf spezifischen MPN-Parametern","Erstellung von Berichten über den Bestand an cyntec-Komponenten unter Verwendung der MPN-Struktur"],"pt":["Decodificação de MPNs da cyntec para identificação de componentes","Automatização da seleção de componentes da cyntec com base em parâmetros de MPN específicos","Geração de relatórios sobre o estoque de componentes da cyntec usando a estrutura do MPN"],"ru":["Декодирование MPN cyntec для идентификации компонентов","Автоматизация выбора компонентов cyntec на основе определенных параметров MPN","Генерация отчетов о запасе компонентов cyntec с использованием структуры MPN"],"ar":["فك تشفير MPN لشركة cyntec لتحديد المكونات","تأتمة اختيار المكونات لشركة cyntec بالاعتماد على معايير MPN محددة","إنتاج تقارير عن المخزون من المكونات لشركة cyntec باستخدام هيكل MPN"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of cyntec''s MPN structure","Limited to cyntec components only"],"zh":["需要了解cyntec的MPN结构","仅限cyntec元件"],"ja":["cyntecのMPN構造の知識が必要","cyntecコンポーネントのみに限定"],"ko":["cyntec의 MPN 구조를 이해해야 함","cyntec 구성 요소에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la estructura de MPN de cyntec","Limitado a componentes de cyntec solamente"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la structure MPN de cyntec","Limité aux composants cyntec uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der MPN-Struktur von cyntec","Begrenzt auf cyntec-Komponenten nur"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da estrutura de MPN da cyntec","Limitado a componentes da cyntec apenas"],"ru":["Требует знания структуры MPN cyntec","Ограничен только компонентами cyntec"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة هيكل MPN لشركة cyntec","محدود بمكونات شركة cyntec فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"79fd03d01f3f1f8e71bed3ea1ec54162f29b62fc4bd02d019af56b641b4c7c99","qualityScore":33}');
