INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ddempsey/co2injection/doublet', 'doublet', 'ddempsey', 'co2injection', 'community', 'doublet ddempsey co2injection community The doublet skill provides physics knowledge for the 2-D doublet model, solving problems along circular streamlines in a potential flow field, benefiting developers and engineers working with streamline methods. Doublet 技术提供流线方法的物理知识，解决二维双曲线模型中的对流-反应-扩散问题 Doublet 技術は流線方法を使用して2次元の双曲線モデルにおける対流-反応-拡散問題を解決します Doublet 기술은 流線 방법을 사용하여 2차원 이중곡선 모델의 대류-반응-확산 문제를 해결합니다 Doublet es un modelo que resuelve problemas de advección-reacción-difusión utilizando métodos de corrientes Doublet est un modèle qui résout des problèmes d''advection-réaction-diffusion en utilisant des méthodes de lignes de courant Doublet ist ein Modell, das Probleme der Advektion-Reaktion-Diffusion mithilfe von Stromlinienmethoden löst O modelo Doublet resolve problemas de advecção-reacção-dispersão em campos de fluxo potencial usando métodos de linha de corrente Модель Doublet решает задачи адвекции-реакции-дисперсии в потенциальном потоке с помощью методов линии тока ينموذج Doublet مشاكل الادفيكشن-التفاعل-التشتت في مجال الجريان المحتمل باستخدام طرق dòng الجريان how to use doublet what is doublet doublet alternative doublet vs other models doublet install guide doublet setup for AI agents streamline model physics advection-reaction-dispersion problems bipolar coordinates in doublet Doublet 技术 流線方法 物理知识 二维双曲线模型 对流-反应-扩散问题 双曲线坐标 传输求解器 突破曲线积分 Solves advection-reaction-dispersion problems along circular streamlines Modifies streamline geometry calculations using bipolar coordinates Changes transport solvers, including hydrodynamic, chemical, and thermal Implements or modifies breakthrough curve integration Works with potential flow fields Doublet is a physics knowledge model using streamline methods to solve advection-reaction-dispersion problems in a potential flow field.');
