です","ko":"Supabase 오프라인 동기화는 Expo 앱을 위한 큐 기반 동기화 기술입니다","es":"Supabase Offline-Sync es una técnica de sincronización que permite a las aplicaciones Expo funcionar sin conexión a Internet","fr":"Supabase Offline-Sync est une technique de synchronisation qui permet aux applications Expo de fonctionner sans connexion à Internet","de":"Supabase Offline-Sync ist eine Synchronisationstechnik, die es Expo-Anwendungen ermöglicht, offline zu funktionieren","pt":"O que é Supabase Offline-Sync? É uma solução de sincronização offline para aplicativos Expo.","ru":"Что такое Supabase Offline-Sync? Это решение для синхронизации в режиме offline для приложений Expo. ИИ Агенты","ar":"ما هو Supabase Offline-Sync؟ هو حل التزامن غير المتصل لأプリكات Expo مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Implements a queue-based sync architecture using SQLite and Supabase","Utilizes a background worker for syncing data between local and remote databases","Supports retry on failure for ensuring data consistency","Creates a sync queue table with id, table_name, record_id, and operation columns","Enforces data integrity with CHECK constraints on operation types"],"zh":["Queue-based 同步架构","SQLite 数据存储","Sync Queue 表","支持离线优先功能","Expo 应用支持","Supabase 集成"],"ja":["キュー ベースの同期アーキテクチャ","SQLite データストア","同期キュー テーブル","オフライン優先機能のサポート","Expo アプリのサポート","Supabase 統合"],"ko":["큐 기반 동기화 아키텍처","SQLite 데이터 저장소","동기화 큐 테이블","오프라인 우선 기능 지원","Expo 앱 지원","Supabase 통합"],"es":["Arquitectura de sincronización basada en cola","Integración con SQLite para almacenamiento local","Compatibilidad con Supabase para sincronización en línea","Reintentos de sincronización en caso de fallo","Soporte para operaciones de inserción, actualización y eliminación"],"fr":["Architecture de synchronisation basée sur une file d''attente","Intégration avec SQLite pour le stockage local","Compatibilité avec Supabase pour la synchronisation en ligne","Réessais de synchronisation en cas d''échec","Prise en charge des opérations d''insertion, de mise à jour et de suppression"],"de":["Synchronisationsarchitektur basierend auf einer Warteschlange","Integration mit SQLite für lokales Speichern","Kompatibilität mit Supabase für Online-Synchronisation","Wiederholung von Synchronisationen im Falle eines Fehlers","Unterstützung für Einfüge-, Aktualisierungs- und Löschoperationen"],"pt":["Arquitetura de fila de sincronização","Utilização de SQLite para armazenamento local","Sincronização offline para aplicativos Expo","Retentativa de sincronização em caso de falha","Suporte à operações de criação, leitura, atualização e exclusão"],"ru":["Архитектура очереди синхронизации","Использование SQLite для локального хранения","Синхронизация в режиме offline для приложений Expo","Повторная синхронизация в случае неудачи","Поддержка операций создания, чтения, обновления и удаления. ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["عمارة طابوقة التزامن","استخدام SQLite لتخزين المحلي","التزامن غير المتصل لأプリكات Expo","إعادة التزامن في حالة الفشل","دعم عمليات الإنشاء والقراءة والتحديث والحذف مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use supabase-offline-sync","supabase-offline-sync setup guide","supabase-offline-sync alternative","supabase-offline-sync vs Expo","supabase-offline-sync install","queue-based sync architecture","offline-first Expo apps","SQLite and Supabase integration"],"zh":["Supabase","离线同步","Queue-based 同步","SQLite","Expo 应用","离线优先功能","同期キュー","AIエージェント","移动应用开发"],"ja":["Supabase","オフライン同期","キュー ベースの同期","SQLite","Expo アプリ","オフライン優先機能","同期キュー","AIエージェント","モバイルアプリ開発"],"ko":["Supabase","오프라인 동기화","큐 기반 동기화","SQLite","Expo 앱","오프라인 우선 기능","동기화 큐","AI 에이전트","모바일 앱 개발"],"es":["Supabase Offline-Sync","sincronización offline","aplicaciones Expo","SQLite","Supabase","arquitectura de sincronización","cola de sincronización","reintentos de sincronización"],"fr":["Supabase Offline-Sync","synchronisation hors ligne","applications Expo","SQLite","Supabase","architecture de synchronisation","file d''attente de synchronisation","réessais de synchronisation"],"de":["Supabase Offline-Sync","Offline-Synchronisation","Expo-Anwendungen","SQLite","Supabase","Synchronisationsarchitektur","Warteschlange der Synchronisation","Wiederholung von Synchronisationen"],"pt":["Supabase Offline-Sync","aplicativos Expo","sincronização offline","SQLite","arquitetura de fila de sincronização","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","soluções de sincronização"],"ru":["Supabase Offline-Sync","приложения Expo","синхронизация в режиме offline","SQLite","архитектура очереди синхронизации","разработка мобильных приложений","решения для синхронизации. ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Supabase Offline-Sync","أプリكات Expo","التزامن غير المتصل","SQLite","عمارة طابوقة التزامن","تطوير التطبيقات المحمولة","حلول التزامن مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"RipKDR","repo":"Steps-to-recovery","repoPath":"RipKDR/Steps-to-recovery","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.300Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"supabase-offline-sync","description":"Implement offline-first sync between Expo SQLite and Supabase with queue-based reconciliation. Use when building offline-first mobile apps, syncing local SQLite with cloud PostgreSQL, handling conflict resolution, implementing background sync, or managing sync queues with retry logic.","bodyPreview":"# Supabase Offline-First Sync\n\nQueue-based sync architecture for offline-first Expo apps using SQLite and Supabase.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\nLocal Write → SQLite → Sync Queue → Background Worker → Supabase\n                              ↑____________↓ (retry on failure)\n```\n\n## Database Schema\n\n### Sync Queue Table\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE sync_queue (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  table_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  record_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n  operation TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (operation IN (''I","body":"# Supabase Offline-First Sync\n\nQueue-based sync architecture for offline-first Expo apps using SQLite and Supabase.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\nLocal Write → SQLite → Sync Queue → Background Worker → Supabase\n                              ↑____________↓ (retry on failure)\n```\n\n## Database Schema\n\n### Sync Queue Table\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE sync_queue (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  table_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  record_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n  operation TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (operation IN (''INSERT'', ''UPDATE'', ''DELETE'')),\n  data TEXT, -- JSON string for INSERT/UPDATE\n  retry_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n  error_message TEXT,\n  created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n  processed_at INTEGER\n);\n\nCREATE INDEX idx_sync_queue_created ON sync_queue(created_at);\nCREATE INDEX idx_sync_queue_processed ON sync_queue(processed_at) WHERE processed_at IS NULL;\n```\n\n## Core Implementation\n\n### 1. Queue Operations\n\n```typescript\ninterface SyncQueueItem {\n  id?: number;\n  table_name: string;\n  record_id: string;\n  operation: ''INSERT'' | ''UPDATE'' | ''DELETE'';\n  data?: string;\n  retry_count: number;\n  created_at: number;\n}\n\nasync function enqueueSync(\n  db: SQLiteDatabase,\n  table: string,\n  recordId: string,\n  operation: ''INSERT'' | ''UPDATE'' | ''DELETE'',\n  data?: object,\n): Promise<void> {\n  await db.runAsync(\n    `INSERT INTO sync_queue (table_name, record_id, operation, data, retry_count, created_at)\n     VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, 0, ?)`,\n    table,\n    recordId,\n    operation,\n    data ? JSON.stringify(data) : null,\n    Date.now(),\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Process Queue\n\n```typescript\nasync function processSyncQueue(db: SQLiteDatabase, supabase: SupabaseClient): Promise<void> {\n  const pending = await db.getAllAsync<SyncQueueItem>(\n    `SELECT * FROM sync_queue \n     WHERE processed_at IS NULL AND retry_count < 5\n     ORDER BY created_at ASC\n     LIMIT 50`,\n  );\n\n  // Process DELETEs first to avoid FK conflicts\n  const deletes = pending.filter((p) => p.operation === ''DELETE'');\n  const others = pending.filter((p) => p.operation !== ''DELETE'');\n\n  for (const item of [...deletes, ...others]) {\n    try {\n      await processQueueItem(db, supabase, item);\n    } catch (error) {\n      await markFailed(db, item.id!, error.message);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Process Individual Item\n\n```typescript\nasync function processQueueItem(\n  db: SQLiteDatabase,\n  supabase: SupabaseClient,\n  item: SyncQueueItem,\n): Promise<void> {\n  const { error } = await supabase.from(item.table_name).upsert(\n    {\n      id: item.record_id,\n      ...(item.data ? JSON.parse(item.data) : {}),\n      updated_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n    },\n    { onConflict: ''id'' },\n  );\n\n  if (error) throw error;\n\n  // Mark as processed\n  await db.runAsync(''UPDATE sync_queue SET processed_at = ? WHERE id = ?'', Date.now(), item.id);\n}\n```\n\n## React Integration\n\n### Sync Context Provider\n\n```typescript\nexport function SyncProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const { db } = useDatabase();\n  const { supabase } = useSupabase();\n  const netInfo = useNetInfo();\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!db || !supabase || !netInfo.isConnected) return;\n\n    // Sync on connection restore\n    const interval = setInterval(() => {\n      processSyncQueue(db, supabase);\n    }, 30000); // Every 30 seconds\n\n    return () => clearInterval(interval);\n  }, [db, supabase, netInfo.isConnected]);\n\n  return children;\n}\n```\n\n## Optimistic Updates Pattern\n\n```typescript\nfunction useCreateJournal() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n  const { db } = useDatabase();\n\n  return useMutation({\n    mutationFn: async (entry: JournalEntry) => {\n      // 1. Save locally\n      await db.runAsync(\n        ''INSERT INTO journal (id, encrypted_body, created_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?)'',\n        entry.id,\n        await encryptContent(entry.content),\n        entry.created_at,\n      );\n\n      // 2. Queue for sync\n      await enqueueSync(db, ''journal'', entry.id, ''INSERT'', entry);\n\n      return entry;\n    },\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [''journal''] });\n    },\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Conflict Resolution\n\nLast-write-wins with server timestamp:\n\n```typescript\nasync function resolveConflict(local: JournalEntry, remote: JournalEntry): Promise<JournalEntry> {\n  const localTime = new Date(local.updated_at).getTime();\n  const remoteTime = new Date(remote.updated_at).getTime();\n\n  return remoteTime > localTime ? remote : local;\n}\n```\n\n## Background Sync (Expo)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as BackgroundFetch from ''expo-background-fetch'';\nimport * as TaskManager from ''expo-task-manager'';\n\nconst SYNC_TASK = ''background-sync'';\n\nTaskManager.defineTask(SYNC_TASK, async () => {\n  const db = await openDatabase();\n  const supabase = createClient();\n\n  try {\n    await processSyncQueue(db, supabase);\n    return BackgroundFetch.BackgroundFetchResult.NewData;\n  } catch {\n    return BackgroundFetch.BackgroundFetchResult.Failed;\n  }\n});\n\nasync function registerBackgroundSync() {\n  await BackgroundFetch.registerTaskAsync(SYNC_TASK, {\n    minimumInterval: 15 * 60, // 15 minutes\n    stopOnTerminate: false,\n    startOnBoot: true,\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Retry Strategy\n\nExponential backoff for failed items:\n\n```typescript\nasync function markFailed(db: SQLiteDatabase, queueId: number, error: string): Promise<void> {\n  await db.runAsync(\n    `UPDATE sync_queue \n     SET retry_count = retry_count + 1,\n         error_message = ?,\n         created_at = ? -- Delay retry\n     WHERE id = ?`,\n    error,\n    Date.now() + Math.pow(2, retry_count) * 60000, // Exponential backoff\n    queueId,\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Process DELETEs first** - Avoids foreign key constraint errors\n2. **Batch operations** - Process 50 items at a time\n3. **Encrypt before sync** - Never send plaintext sensitive data\n4. **User-scoped sync** - Always filter by `user_id` in Supabase RLS\n5. **Retry limit** - Max 5 retries before manual intervention\n6. **Conflict timestamps** - Use `updated_at` for last-write-wins\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:33.104Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing seamless offline data synchronization with Supabase and SQLite","zh":"适合需要与 Supabase 和 SQLite 实现无缝离线数据同步的移动应用代理","ja":"Supabase 및 SQLite とシームレスなオフラインデータ同期が必要なモバイルアプリエージェントに最適","ko":"Supabase와 SQLite를 사용한 무제한 오프라인 데이터 동기화가 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan una sincronización de datos sin conexión con Supabase y SQLite","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Applications Mobiles ayant besoin d''une synchronisation de données hors ligne avec Supabase et SQLite","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die eine nahtlose Offline-Datensynchronisierung mit Supabase und SQLite benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de sincronização de dados offline sem interrupções com Supabase e SQLite","ru":"Идеально для агентов мобильных приложений, требующих бесшовной синхронизации данных в автономном режиме с Supabase и SQLite","ar":"مثالي للعميل تطبيق الجوال الذين بحاجة إلى تنسيق بيانات دون اتصال بسلاسة مع Supabase و SQLite"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build offline-first Expo apps with a queue-based sync architecture, utilizing SQLite for local storage and Supabase for cloud synchronization, ensuring reliable data consistency across online and offline modes","zh":"赋予代理构建离线优先的 Expo 应用程序的能力，采用基于队列的同步架构，利用 SQLite 进行本地存储，利用 Supabase 进行云同步，确保在线和离线模式之间的数据一致性","ja":"エージェントがオフライン優先の Expo アプリを構築する能力を提供します。キュー ベースの同期アーキテクチャを使用して、SQLite をローカル ストレージに、Supabase をクラウド同期に利用し、オンラインとオフライン モード間のデータの一貫性を確保します","ko":"에이전트가 오프라인 우선의 Expo 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 제공하여 큐 기반의 동기화 아키텍처를 사용하고, SQLite를 로컬 저장소로, Supabase를 클라우드 동기화로 활용하여 온라인과 오프라인 모드 간의 데이터 일관성을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones Expo de primera línea con una arquitectura de sincronización basada en cola, utilizando SQLite para el almacenamiento local 