INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('RipKDR/Steps-to-recovery/supabase-offline-sync', 'supabase-offline-sync', 'RipKDR', 'Steps-to-recovery', 'community', 'supabase-offline-sync RipKDR Steps-to-recovery community The supabase-offline-sync skill enables developers to build offline-first Expo apps using SQLite and Supabase, with a queue-based sync architecture. It benefits developers building mobile apps that require offline data synchronization. Supabase 离线同步是一种 Queue-based 同步架构，用于 Expo 应用的离线优先功能，利用 SQLite 和 Supabase 实现数据同步 Supabase オフライン同期は、Expo アプリのオフライン優先機能を実現するためのキュー ベースの同期アーキテクチャです。SQLite と Supabase を使用してデータを同期します Supabase 오프라인 동기화는 Expo 앱의 오프라인 우선 기능을 구현하기 위한 큐 기반 동기화 아키텍처입니다. SQLite 및 Supabase를 사용하여 데이터를 동기화합니다 Supabase Offline-Sync es una arquitectura de sincronización basada en cola para aplicaciones Expo con SQLite y Supabase Supabase Offline-Sync est une architecture de synchronisation basée sur une file d''attente pour les applications Expo avec SQLite et Supabase Supabase Offline-Sync ist eine synchronisationsbasierte Architektur für Expo-Anwendungen mit SQLite und Supabase O Supabase Offline-Sync é uma solução de sincronização offline para aplicativos Expo, utilizando SQLite e arquitetura de fila de sincronização. Supabase Offline-Sync - это решение для синхронизации в режиме offline для приложений Expo, использующее SQLite и архитектуру очереди синхронизации. ИИ Агенты Supabase Offline-Sync هو حل التزامن غير المتصل لأプリكات Expo، يستخدم SQLite وعمارة طابوقة التزامن مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي how to use supabase-offline-sync supabase-offline-sync setup guide supabase-offline-sync alternative supabase-offline-sync vs Expo supabase-offline-sync install queue-based sync architecture offline-first Expo apps SQLite and Supabase integration Supabase 离线同步 Queue-based 同步 SQLite Expo 应用 离线优先功能 同期キュー AIエージェント 移动应用开发 Implements a queue-based sync architecture using SQLite and Supabase Utilizes a background worker for syncing data between local and remote databases Supports retry on failure for ensuring data consistency Creates a sync queue table with id, table_name, record_id, and operation columns Enforces data integrity with CHECK constraints on operation types supabase-offline-sync is a queue-based sync architecture for offline-first Expo apps using SQLite and Supabase, enabling seamless data synchronization between local and remote databases.');
