 herramienta de túneles seguros en Rust, similar a ngrok, que permite a los desarrolladores crear túneles seguros para sus aplicaciones","fr":"zgrok-developer est un outil de tunnels sécurisés en Rust, similaire à ngrok, qui permet aux développeurs de créer des tunnels sécurisés pour leurs applications","de":"zgrok-developer ist ein Tool für sichere Tunnel in Rust, ähnlich wie ngrok, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, sichere Tunnel für ihre Anwendungen zu erstellen","pt":"O zgrok-developer é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento em Rust que fornece uma alternativa auto-hospedada ao ngrok","ru":"zgrok-developer - это инструмент для разработчиков на основе Rust, предоставляющий автономную альтернативу ngrok и ИИ Агенты","ar":"zgrok-developer هو أداة تطوير مُضمنة في Rust توفر بديلاً ذاتي الاستضافة ل ngrok وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Built using Rust for enhanced security and performance","Self-hosted ngrok alternative for secure tunneling","Development guided by detailed specs in the issues section","Allows for customizable and flexible tunneling configurations","Utilizes Markdown files, such as SKILL.md, for documentation and guidance"],"zh":["使用 Rust 编程语言开发","自托管 ngrok 替代品","支持 /// 文档注释","支持 // TODO: 和 // FIXME: 注释","支持 // SAFETY: 注释"],"ja":["Rust プログラミング言語で開発","自ホスト ngrok 代替品","/// ドキュメントコメントのサポート","// TODO: と // FIXME: コメントのサポート","// SAFETY: コメントのサポート"],"ko":["러스트 프로그래밍 언어로 개발","자체 호스팅 ngrok 대체","/// 문서 주석 지원","// TODO: 및 // FIXME: 주석 지원","// SAFETY: 주석 지원"],"es":["Desarrollado en Rust para mayor seguridad y rendimiento","Alternativa a ngrok para túneles seguros","Permite comentarios de documentación para API pública","Soporta bloques de código no seguros con comentarios de seguridad","Código auto-documentado para mayor legibilidad"],"fr":["Développé en Rust pour une sécurité et des performances accrues","Alternative à ngrok pour les tunnels sécurisés","Permet des commentaires de documentation pour l''API publique","Prend en charge les blocs de code non sécurisés avec des commentaires de sécurité","Code auto-documenté pour une meilleure lisibilité"],"de":["In Rust entwickelt für mehr Sicherheit und Leistung","Alternative zu ngrok für sichere Tunnel","Ermöglicht Dokumentationskommentare für öffentliche API","Unterstützt unsichere Codeblöcke mit Sicherheitskommentaren","Selbst-dokumentierender Code für bessere Lesbarkeit"],"pt":["Desenvolvido em Rust","Alternativa auto-hospedada ao ngrok","Código auto-documentado","Comentários de documentação para API pública","Suporte a blocos de código não seguros"],"ru":["Разработан на основе Rust","Самостоятельная альтернатива ngrok","Самодокументирующийся код","Комментарии документации для публичного API","Поддержка небезопасных блоков кода и ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تم تطويره باستخدام Rust","بديل ذاتي الاستضافة ل ngrok","كود مُضمن يوثق نفسه","تعليقات توثيق ل API العامة","دعم الكتل غير الآمنة من الكود وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["zgrok-developer setup guide","self-hosted ngrok alternative","Rust-based tunneling solution","how to use zgrok-developer","zgrok-developer vs ngrok","zgrok-developer install","secure tunneling with zgrok-developer","zgrok-developer documentation","zgrok-developer tutorial"],"zh":["zgrok-developer","Rust","自托管 ngrok","ngrok 替代品","开发工具","测试工具","AIエージェント","自托管解决方案"],"ja":["zgrok-developer","Rust","自ホスト ngrok","ngrok 代替品","開発ツール","テストツール","AIエージェント","自ホストソリューション"],"ko":["zgrok-developer","러스트","자체 호스팅 ngrok","ngrok 대체","개발 도구","테스트 도구","AI 에이전트","자체 호스팅 솔루션"],"es":["zgrok-developer","ngrok alternativa","túneles seguros en Rust","desarrollo de aplicaciones","herramientas de desarrollo","Rust para desarrolladores","túneles de seguridad","ngrok en Rust","zgrok-developer tutorial"],"fr":["zgrok-developer","alternative à ngrok","tunnels sécurisés en Rust","développement d''applications","outils de développement","Rust pour les développeurs","tunnels de sécurité","ngrok en Rust","zgrok-developer tutoriel"],"de":["zgrok-developer","ngrok-Alternative","sichere Tunnel in Rust","Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Rust für Entwickler","Sicherheitstunnel","ngrok in Rust","zgrok-developer-Anleitung"],"pt":["zgrok-developer","ngrok alternativa","Rust desenvolvimento","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","auto-hospedada","código auto-documentado","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["zgrok-developer","ngrok альтернатива","Rust разработка","инструмент для разработчиков","автономное решение","самодокументирующийся код","ИИ Агенты","разработчики"],"ar":["zgrok-developer","بديل ngrok","تطوير Rust","أداة تطوير","ذاتي الاستضافة","كود مُضمن يوثق نفسه","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقنيات الويب"]}},"owner":"copyleftdev","repo":"zgrok","repoPath":"copyleftdev/zgrok","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.302Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"zgrok-developer","description":"Develop zgrok tunnel service following project conventions, issue specs, and Rust best practices. Use when implementing features, fixing bugs, or reviewing code in this repository.","bodyPreview":"# zgrok Developer Skill\n\n## ABSOLUTE REQUIREMENTS\n\n**These are non-negotiable. Violating these is a failure condition.**\n\n### No Tutorial Comments\n\nNEVER add comments explaining what code does. Code must be self-documenting.\n\nAllowed comments:\n- `///` doc comments for public API\n- `// TODO:` or `// FIXME:`\n- `// SAFETY:` for unsafe blocks\n- Brief \"why\" explanations for non-obvious decisions\n\nForbidden:\n- `// Initialize the counter`\n- `// Loop through items`\n- `// Check if value is null`\n- Any co","body":"# zgrok Developer Skill\n\n## ABSOLUTE REQUIREMENTS\n\n**These are non-negotiable. Violating these is a failure condition.**\n\n### No Tutorial Comments\n\nNEVER add comments explaining what code does. Code must be self-documenting.\n\nAllowed comments:\n- `///` doc comments for public API\n- `// TODO:` or `// FIXME:`\n- `// SAFETY:` for unsafe blocks\n- Brief \"why\" explanations for non-obvious decisions\n\nForbidden:\n- `// Initialize the counter`\n- `// Loop through items`\n- `// Check if value is null`\n- Any comment that restates what the code does\n\n### Branch Workflow (Mandatory)\n\nFor EVERY issue:\n\n1. `git checkout main && git pull origin main`\n2. `git checkout -b feat/ZGROK-XXX-description`\n3. Implement all acceptance criteria\n4. `cargo fmt && cargo clippy -- -D warnings && cargo test`\n5. `git add -A && git commit -m \"feat(component): ZGROK-XXX - title\"`\n6. `git push -u origin feat/ZGROK-XXX-description`\n7. `gh pr create --fill`\n8. Self-review the diff\n9. `gh pr merge --squash --delete-branch`\n10. `git checkout main && git pull origin main`\n11. Report completion, await next issue\n\n**NEVER leave PRs open. NEVER work multiple issues. NEVER skip steps.**\n\n## Overview\n\nzgrok is a self-hosted ngrok alternative. This skill encodes project-specific knowledge for effective development.\n\n## Issue-Driven Development\n\nAll work traces to issues in `.github/issues/`. Each issue contains:\n\n- **Acceptance Criteria**: Testable Given/When/Then statements\n- **State Machines**: For stateful components (connections, streams)\n- **Technical Context**: Exact crates, files, data structures to use\n- **Dependencies**: What must exist before this can be implemented\n\n### Reading an Issue\n\n```bash\ncat .github/issues/stories/protocol/ZGROK-010-frame-types.json | jq\n```\n\n### Checking Dependencies\n\n```bash\ncat .github/issues/_index.json | jq ''.dependency_graph[\"ZGROK-012\"]''\n```\n\n## Architecture Principles\n\n1. **Async-first**: Everything uses Tokio. No blocking in async context.\n2. **Protocol-agnostic core**: The multiplexer works over any `AsyncRead + AsyncWrite`.\n3. **Graceful degradation**: Connection loss → reconnect, not crash.\n4. **Observable**: Every component emits tracing spans and metrics.\n\n## Code Patterns\n\n### Error Handling\n\n```rust\n// Library crates: use thiserror\n#[derive(Debug, thiserror::Error)]\npub enum ProtocolError {\n    #[error(\"invalid frame type: {0}\")]\n    InvalidFrameType(u8),\n    #[error(\"stream {0} not found\")]\n    StreamNotFound(u32),\n    #[error(\"io error: {0}\")]\n    Io(#[from] std::io::Error),\n}\n\n// Binary crates: use anyhow\nfn main() -> anyhow::Result<()> {\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\n### Tracing\n\n```rust\nuse tracing::{debug, info, instrument, warn};\n\n#[instrument(skip(stream), fields(stream_id = %stream.id()))]\nasync fn handle_stream(stream: Stream) -> Result<(), Error> {\n    info!(\"processing stream\");\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\n### State Machines\n\nImplement exactly as specified in issue `state_machine` field:\n\n```rust\n#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq, Eq)]\npub enum StreamState {\n    Open,\n    HalfClosedLocal,\n    HalfClosedRemote,\n    Closed,\n}\n\nimpl StreamState {\n    pub fn can_send(&self) -> bool {\n        matches!(self, Self::Open | Self::HalfClosedRemote)\n    }\n    \n    pub fn can_recv(&self) -> bool {\n        matches!(self, Self::Open | Self::HalfClosedLocal)\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Strategy\n\n1. **Unit tests**: Per-function, alongside code\n2. **Property tests**: Protocol codec with `proptest`\n3. **Integration tests**: Full tunnel flow in `tests/`\n\n```rust\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod tests {\n    use super::*;\n    \n    #[test]\n    fn test_frame_roundtrip() {\n        // Maps to AC: Given valid frame, When encoded then decoded, Then equals original\n        let frame = Frame::Data { stream_id: 1, payload: b\"hello\".to_vec() };\n        let encoded = frame.encode();\n        let decoded = Frame::decode(&encoded).unwrap();\n        assert_eq!(frame, decoded);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## File Organization\n\n```\ncrates/\n├── zgrok-protocol/src/\n│   ├── lib.rs          # Public API, re-exports\n│   ├── frame.rs        # Frame types and codec\n│   ├── codec.rs        # Tokio codec impl\n│   ├── mux.rs          # Stream multiplexer\n│   └── error.rs        # Protocol errors\n├── zgrok-agent/src/\n│   ├── main.rs         # CLI entry\n│   ├── cli.rs          # Clap definitions\n│   ├── tunnel.rs       # Connection management\n│   ├── forwarder.rs    # Local HTTP forwarding\n│   └── tui/            # Terminal UI\n└── zgrok-edge/src/\n    ├── main.rs\n    ├── acceptor.rs     # Agent connection handling\n    ├── router.rs       # Subdomain routing\n    └── bridge.rs       # HTTP-to-tunnel bridging\n```\n\n## Commit Convention\n\n```\nfeat(protocol): ZGROK-010 - define frame types and binary format\nfix(agent): ZGROK-033 - handle reconnection edge case\ntest(edge): ZGROK-054 - add agent acceptor integration tests\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:40.137Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Secure Tunneling Agents requiring a self-hosted, customizable, and Rust-based ngrok alternative for secure development environments.","zh":"适合需要自托管、可定制且基于Rust的ngrok替代品的安全隧道代理，用于安全开发环境。","ja":"セキュアな開発環境用のセルフホスト型、カスタマイズ可能、Rustベースのngrokの代替品を必要とするセキュアトンネリングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"보안 개발 환경을 위한 자체 호스팅, 사용자 정의 및 Rust 기반의 ngrok 대안을 요구하는 보안 터널링 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Túneles Seguros que requieren una alternativa de ngrok autohospedada, personalizable y basada en Rust para entornos de desarrollo seguros.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de tunneling sécurisés nécessitant une alternative auto-hébergée, personnalisable et basée sur Rust pour des environnements de développement sécurisés.","de":"Ideal für sichere Tunnelagenten, die eine selbstgehostete, anpassbare und auf Rust basierende ngrok-Alternative für sichere Entwicklungsumgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Túnel Seguro que exigem um ngrok auto-hospedado, personalizável e baseado em Rust para ambientes de desenvolvimento seguros.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Безопасных Туннельных Агентов, требующих самохостингового, настраиваемого и основанного на Rust альтернативы ngrok для безопасных сред разработки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل النفق الآمن الذي يتطلب تطبيق نغروك ذاتي الاستضافة ويمكن تخصيصه ويعتمد على روست للمطورات الآمنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create secure and customizable tunneling solutions using zgrok-developer, leveraging Rust for performance and security, and supporting detailed specs for advanced configurations via the issues section, with features like public API documentation using /// doc comments.","zh":"赋予代理创建安全且可定制的隧道解决方案的能力，利用zgrok-developer和Rust实现高性能和安全性，并通过问题部分支持高级配置的详细规格，具有使用///文档注释的公共API文档等功能。","ja":"zgrok-developerとRustを利用して、セキュアでカスタマイズ可能なトンネリングソリューションを作成するエージェントの能力を強化し、高度な構成の詳細な仕様を問題セクションでサポートし、///ドキュメントコメントを使用したパブリックAPIドキュメントなどの機能を提供します。","ko":"zgrok-developer와 Rust를 활용하여 보안 및 사용자 정의 가능한 터널링 솔루션을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화하며, 문제 섹션에서 고급 구성의詳細 사양을 지원하며, /// 문서 주석을 사용한 공개 API 문서 등의 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear soluciones de tunneling seguras y personalizables utilizando zgrok-developer, aprovechando Rust para el rendimiento y la seguridad, y admitiendo especificaciones detalladas para configuraciones avanzadas a través de la sección de problemas, con características como documentación de API pública utilizando comentarios /// doc.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des solutions de tunneling sécurisées et personnalisables en utilisant zgrok-developer, en exploitant Rust pour les performances et la sécurité, et en prenant en charge des spécifications détaillées pour des configurations avancées via la section des problèmes, avec des fonctionnalités comme la documentation de l''API publique en utilisant des commentaires /// doc.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere und anpassbare Tunneling-Lösungen mit zgrok-developer zu erstellen, Rust für Leistung und Sicherheit nutzt und detaillierte Spezifikationen für erweiterte Konfigurationen über den Issues-Bereich unterstützt, mit Funktionen wie öffentlicher API-Dokumentation mit ///-Doc-Kommentaren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar soluções de túnel seguras e personalizáveis usando zgrok-developer, aproveitando Rust para desempenho e segurança, e suportando especificações detalhadas para configurações avançadas via seção de problemas, com recursos como documentação de API pública usando comentários /// doc.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать безопасные и настраиваемые решения туннелирования с использованием zgrok-developer, используя Rust для производительности и безопасности, и поддерживая подробные спецификации для расширенных конфигураций через раздел проблем, с функциями, такими как публичная документация API с использованием комментариев /// doc.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء حلول نفق آمنة ويمكن تخصيصها باستخدام zgrok-developer، وتحقيق الأداء والأمان باستخدام روست، ودعم المواصفات التفصيلية للتركيبات المتقدمة عبر قسم المشاكل، مع ميزات مثل توثيق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات العامة باستخدام تعليقات /// doc."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing self-hosted tunneling solutions","Customizing ngrok alternatives for specific use cases","Implementing secure and performant tunneling protocols using Rust"],"zh":["开发自托管隧道解决方案","为特定用例自定义ngrok替代品","使用Rust实现安全且高性能的隧道协议"],"ja":["セルフホスト型トンネリングソリューションの開発","特定のユースケース用にngrokの代替品をカスタマイズする","Rustを使用してセキュアで高性能なトンネリングプロトコルを実装する"],"ko":["자체 호스팅 터널링 솔루션 개발","특정 용례를 위한 ngrok 대안 사용자 정의","Rust를 사용하여 보안 및 고성능 터널링 프로토콜 구현"],"es":["Desarrollar soluciones de túneles autohospedados","Personalizar alternativas de ngrok para casos de uso específicos","Implementar protocolos de túneles seguros y de alto rendimiento utilizando Rust"],"fr":["Développer des solutions de tunneling auto-hébergées","Personnaliser des alternatives à ngrok pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques","Mettre en œuvre des protocoles de tunneling sécurisés et performants en utilisant Rust"],"de":["Entwicklung von selbstgehosteten Tunneling-Lösungen","Anpassen von ngrok-Alternativen für spezifische Anwendungsfälle","Implementierung von sicheren und leistungsstarken Tunneling-Protokollen mit Rust"],"pt":["Desenvolver soluções de túnel auto-hospedadas","Personalizar alternativas ngrok para casos de uso específicos","Implementar protocolos de túnel seguros e performáticos usando