INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('copyleftdev/zgrok/zgrok-developer', 'zgrok-developer', 'copyleftdev', 'zgrok', 'community', 'zgrok-developer copyleftdev zgrok community zgrok-developer is a self-hosted ngrok alternative in Rust, designed for developers seeking a secure and customizable tunneling solution. It is currently under development, with detailed specs available in the issues section. zgrok-developer 是一个使用 Rust 开发的自托管 ngrok 替代品，目前处于开发中 zgrok-developer は Rust で開発された自ホスト ngrok 代替品で、現在開発中 zgrok-developer는 러스트로 개발된 자체 호스팅 ngrok 대체品으로 개발 중 zgrok-developer es una alternativa de ngrok en Rust para túneles seguros. Está en desarrollo, consulta los issues para obtener especificaciones detalladas zgrok-developer est une alternative à ngrok en Rust pour les tunnels sécurisés. Il est en développement, consultez les issues pour obtenir des spécifications détaillées zgrok-developer ist eine ngrok-Alternative in Rust für sichere Tunnel. Es ist in Entwicklung, siehe Issues für detaillierte Spezifikationen O zgrok-developer é uma alternativa ao ngrok em Rust, projetada para desenvolvedores que buscam uma solução auto-hospedada. zgrok-developer - это самостоятельная альтернатива ngrok на основе Rust, предназначенная для разработчиков, ищущих автономное решение и ИИ Агенты zgrok-developer هو بديل ngrok مُضمن في Rust، مصمم لتقنيات الويب الذين يبحثون عن حل ذاتي الاستضافة وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي zgrok-developer setup guide self-hosted ngrok alternative Rust-based tunneling solution how to use zgrok-developer zgrok-developer vs ngrok zgrok-developer install secure tunneling with zgrok-developer zgrok-developer documentation zgrok-developer tutorial zgrok-developer Rust 自托管 ngrok ngrok 替代品 开发工具 测试工具 AIエージェント 自托管解决方案 Built using Rust for enhanced security and performance Self-hosted ngrok alternative for secure tunneling Development guided by detailed specs in the issues section Allows for customizable and flexible tunneling configurations Utilizes Markdown files, such as SKILL.md, for documentation and guidance zgrok-developer is a self-hosted, open-source alternative to ngrok, built using the Rust programming language, aiming to provide a secure and reliable tunneling solution.');
