INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('crmagz/cdk-constructs-library/naming-conventions', 'naming-conventions', 'crmagz', 'cdk-constructs-library', 'community', 'naming-conventions crmagz cdk-constructs-library community The naming-conventions skill provides a comprehensive library for AWS CDK, enabling developers to follow type-driven development principles and apply consistent naming conventions to their infrastructure-as-code constructs. 命名约定是 AWS CDK 代码库的核心，提供 Type Naming 和 camelCase 的使用指南 ネーミング規約は AWS CDK ライブラリの重要な概念です。Type Naming と camelCase の使用方法を紹介します 네이밍 규칙은 AWS CDK 인프라스트럭처의 핵심입니다. Type Naming과 camelCase의 사용법을 가이드합니다 La convención de nomenclatura es crucial en el desarrollo de infraestructura como código. Nuestra guía te ayudará a establecer convenciones de nomenclatura efectivas para tus proyectos AWS CDK. La convention de nommage est cruciale dans le développement d''infrastructures en tant que code. Notre guide vous aidera à établir des conventions de nommage efficaces pour vos projets AWS CDK. Die Namenskonvention ist entscheidend für die Entwicklung von Infrastrukturen als Code. Unser Leitfaden hilft Ihnen, effektive Namenskonventionen für Ihre AWS-CDK-Projekte zu etablieren. Conheça as convenções de nomenclatura para desenvolvedores, com foco em type declarations e camelCase, para melhorar a legibilidade do código Ознакомьтесь с конвенциями именования для разработчиков, с фокусом на type declarations и camelCase, для улучшения читаемости кода تعرف على اتفاقيات التسمية للمطورين، مع التركيز على إعلانات النوع و camelCase، لتحسين قراءة الكود how to use naming-conventions in AWS CDK naming-conventions best practices for AWS developers what is naming-conventions in AWS Cloud Development Kit naming-conventions vs other coding standards naming-conventions setup guide for AWS CDK projects naming-conventions install for AWS Cloud Development Kit 命名约定 AWS CDK Type Naming camelCase infrastructure-as-code Type-driven development AWS CDK 代码库 命名规则 Uses `type` declarations instead of `interface` for type-driven development Applies PascalCase convention to Types and Enums, such as `EnvironmentConfig` and `CodeArtifactStackProps` Employs camelCase convention for Functions and Variables Provides a comprehensive library for AWS CDK infrastructure-as-code constructs Supports consistent naming conventions for AWS applications Follows established conventions for `BucketProps` and other AWS resources naming-conventions is a set of guidelines for AWS Cloud Development Kit developers to follow type-driven development principles and apply consistent naming conventions to their code');
