 MCP Server para JIRA","ru":"Настройка Сервера Atlassian MCP для JIRA: ИИ Агенты","ar":"دليل إعداد خادم Atlassian MCP لجيرا"},"description":{"en":"Unlock direct access to JIRA and Confluence from coding agents with atlassian-mcp. Learn how to enable and configure the Atlassian MCP Server today!","zh":"了解如何配置 Atlassian MCP 服务器以访问 JIRA 和 Confluence 数据，实现 Cursor 或 Claude Code 的直接访问","ja":"Atlassian MCP サーバーの設定方法を学び、JIRA と Confluence のデータに直接アクセスする","ko":"Atlassian MCP 서버 설정 방법을 알아보고 JIRA 및 Confluence 데이터에 직접 액세스하십시오","es":"Aprende a configurar el servidor Atlassian MCP para acceso directo a JIRA y Confluence desde agentes de codificación","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer le serveur Atlassian MCP pour accéder directement à JIRA et Confluence à partir d''agents de codage","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie den Atlassian-MCP-Server für direkten Zugriff auf JIRA und Confluence von Codierungsagenten konfigurieren","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Atlassian MCP Server para acessar JIRA e Confluence de forma direta com os agentes de codificação","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить Сервер Atlassian MCP для прямого доступа к JIRA и Confluence из кодирующих агентов ИИ","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد خادم Atlassian MCP للوصول المباشر إلى جيرا وكونفلونس من خلال وكلاء التشفير"},"definition":{"en":"atlassian-mcp is a server that provides direct access to JIRA and Confluence from coding agents, allowing for streamlined development and integration.","zh":"Atlassian MCP 服务器是一种提供对 JIRA 和 Confluence 数据直接访问的服务器","ja":"Atlassian MCP サーバーは、JIRA と Confluence のデータに直接アクセスするためのサーバー","ko":"Atlassian MCP 서버는 JIRA 및 Confluence 데이터에 직접 액세스할 수 있는 서버입니다","es":"Atlassian MCP es un servidor que permite el acceso directo a JIRA y Confluence desde agentes de codificación","fr":"Atlassian MCP est un serveur qui permet l''accès direct à JIRA et Confluence à partir d''agents de codage","de":"Atlassian MCP ist ein Server, der den direkten Zugriff auf JIRA und Confluence von Codierungsagenten ermöglicht","pt":"O Atlassian MCP Server é um servidor que fornece acesso direto ao JIRA e Confluence","ru":"Сервер Atlassian MCP - это сервер, обеспечивающий прямой доступ к JIRA и Confluence","ar":"خادم Atlassian MCP هو خادم يوفر الوصول المباشر إلى جيرا وكونفلونس"},"features":{"en":["Provides direct access to JIRA and Confluence from coding agents","Supports configuration via `~/.cursor/mcp.json` file","Enables access to Atlassian data from Cursor or Claude Code","Allows for global configuration of the Atlassian MCP Server","Supports JSON format for configuration settings"],"zh":["支持 Cursor 或 Claude Code 的开发","提供对 JIRA 和 Confluence 数据的直接访问","配置简单，仅需启用 Atlassian-MCP-Server","支持 JSON 配置文件","能够在 ~/.cursor/mcp.json 中配置"],"ja":["Cursor または Claude Code の開発をサポート","JIRA と Confluence のデータに直接アクセス","設定が簡単に、Atlassian-MCP-Server を有効にするだけ","JSON 構成ファイルをサポート"," ~/.cursor/mcp.json で構成可能"],"ko":["Cursor 또는 Claude Code 개발 지원","JIRA 및 Confluence 데이터에 직접 액세스","설정 간단, Atlassian-MCP-Server 활성화만으로 가능","JSON 구성 파일 지원"," ~/.cursor/mcp.json에서 구성 가능"],"es":["Acceso directo a JIRA y Confluence","Configuración global en Cursor","Habilitación del servidor Atlassian MCP en la configuración de Cursor","Soporte para agentes de codificación como Cursor o Claude Code","Configuración del servidor Atlassian MCP mediante el archivo mcp.json"],"fr":["Accès direct à JIRA et Confluence","Configuration globale dans Cursor","Activation du serveur Atlassian MCP dans la configuration de Cursor","Prise en charge d''agents de codage tels que Cursor ou Claude Code","Configuration du serveur Atlassian MCP via le fichier mcp.json"],"de":["Direkter Zugriff auf JIRA und Confluence","Globale Konfiguration in Cursor","Aktivierung des Atlassian-MCP-Servers in der Cursor-Konfiguration","Unterstützung für Codierungsagenten wie Cursor oder Claude Code","Konfiguration des Atlassian-MCP-Servers über die Datei mcp.json"],"pt":["Acesso direto ao JIRA e Confluence","Configuração global no Cursor","Habilitação do Atlassian-MCP-Server nas configurações do Cursor","Arquivo de configuração em JSON","Integração com agentes de codificação"],"ru":["Прямой доступ к JIRA и Confluence","Глобальная конфигурация в Cursor","Включение Сервера Atlassian-MCP в настройках Cursor","Файл конфигурации в формате JSON","Интеграция с кодирующими агентами ИИ"],"ar":["الوصول المباشر إلى جيرا وكونفلونس","التكوين العالمي في Cursor","تمكين خادم Atlassian-MCP في إعدادات Cursor","ملف التكوين بتنسيق JSON","التكامل مع وكلاء التشفير"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use atlassian-mcp","atlassian-mcp setup guide","atlassian-mcp alternative","atlassian-mcp vs cursor","atlassian-mcp install","what is atlassian-mcp","atlassian-mcp configuration","atlassian-mcp for AI agents"],"zh":["Atlassian MCP 服务器","JIRA 数据访问","Confluence 数据访问","Cursor 开发","Claude Code 开发","AI 工具","JSON 配置"],"ja":["Atlassian MCP サーバー","JIRA データ アクセス","Confluence データ アクセス","Cursor 開発","Claude Code 開発","AI エージェント","JSON 構成"],"ko":["Atlassian MCP 서버","JIRA 데이터 액세스","Confluence 데이터 액세스","Cursor 개발","Claude Code 개발","AI 에이전트","JSON 구성"],"es":["Atlassian MCP","servidor Atlassian MCP","configuración de Atlassian MCP","acceso directo a JIRA","acceso directo a Confluence","agentes de codificación","Cursor","Claude Code","mcp.json"],"fr":["Atlassian MCP","serveur Atlassian MCP","configuration d''Atlassian MCP","accès direct à JIRA","accès direct à Confluence","agents de codage","Cursor","Claude Code","mcp.json"],"de":["Atlassian MCP","Atlassian-MCP-Server","Konfiguration von Atlassian MCP","direkter Zugriff auf JIRA","direkter Zugriff auf Confluence","Codierungsagenten","Cursor","Claude Code","mcp.json"],"pt":["atlassian mcp server","jira e confluence","agentes de codificação","configuração do cursor","arquivo de configuração json","integração com agentes de codificação"],"ru":["Сервер Atlassian MCP","JIRA и Confluence","ИИ агенты","настройка Cursor","файл конфигурации JSON","интеграция с кодирующими агентами"],"ar":["خادم Atlassian MCP","جيرا وكونفلونس","وكلاء التشفير","إعدادات Cursor","ملف التكوين JSON","التكامل مع وكلاء التشفير"]}},"owner":"orient-bot","repo":"orient","repoPath":"orient-bot/orient","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.296Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"atlassian-mcp","description":"Use the Atlassian MCP Server to interact with JIRA from coding agents (Cursor, Claude Code). This skill documents how to use the official Atlassian MCP server for JIRA and Confluence operations. Enable this MCP server in your Cursor/Claude Code settings for JIRA access.","bodyPreview":"# Atlassian MCP Server for JIRA\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server provides direct access to JIRA and Confluence from coding agents. This is the supported way to access Atlassian data from Cursor or Claude Code.\n\n## Setup\n\n### In Cursor\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server is already configured globally. To enable it:\n\n1. Open Cursor Settings\n2. Go to Tools & MCP\n3. Enable \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\"\n\nConfiguration location: `~/.cursor/mcp.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\": {\n      \"url\": \"ht","body":"# Atlassian MCP Server for JIRA\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server provides direct access to JIRA and Confluence from coding agents. This is the supported way to access Atlassian data from Cursor or Claude Code.\n\n## Setup\n\n### In Cursor\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server is already configured globally. To enable it:\n\n1. Open Cursor Settings\n2. Go to Tools & MCP\n3. Enable \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\"\n\nConfiguration location: `~/.cursor/mcp.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\": {\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.atlassian.com/v1/sse\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### In Claude Code\n\nAdd to your Claude Code MCP settings:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"Atlassian-MCP-Server\": {\n      \"url\": \"https://mcp.atlassian.com/v1/sse\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Available Tools\n\nWhen enabled, the Atlassian MCP Server provides these tools:\n\n### Issue Operations\n\n| Tool                                     | Description                     |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_getJiraIssue`             | Get details of a specific issue |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_createJiraIssue`          | Create a new issue              |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_editJiraIssue`            | Update an existing issue        |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_transitionJiraIssue`      | Change issue status             |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_searchJiraIssuesUsingJql` | Search issues with JQL          |\n\n### Comments\n\n| Tool                                  | Description                |\n| ------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_addCommentToJiraIssue` | Add a comment to an issue  |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_getJiraIssueComments`  | Get comments from an issue |\n\n### Confluence (if enabled)\n\n| Tool                                 | Description              |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------ |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_createConfluencePage` | Create a Confluence page |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_getConfluencePage`    | Get a Confluence page    |\n| `mcp_Atlassian_searchConfluence`     | Search Confluence        |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Get Issue Details\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_getJiraIssue with issueKey: \"PROJ-123\"\n```\n\n### Search for Issues\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_searchJiraIssuesUsingJql with:\n  jql: \"project = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = ''YOUR_COMPONENT'' AND status = ''In Progress''\"\n```\n\n### Create an Issue\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_createJiraIssue with:\n  project: \"YOUR_PROJECT\"\n  issueType: \"Story\"\n  summary: \"Implement new feature\"\n  description: \"Description of the feature\"\n  components: [\"YOUR_COMPONENT\"]\n```\n\n### Transition Issue Status\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_transitionJiraIssue with:\n  issueKey: \"PROJ-123\"\n  transition: \"In Progress\"\n```\n\n### Add Comment\n\n```\nUse mcp_Atlassian_addCommentToJiraIssue with:\n  issueKey: \"PROJ-123\"\n  comment: \"Started working on this issue\"\n```\n\n## JQL Quick Reference\n\nCommon JQL queries for the Orient Task Force:\n\n```jql\n# All issues for YOUR_COMPONENT\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\"\n\n# In Progress issues\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND status = \"In Progress\"\n\n# Blockers\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND (priority = Blocker OR labels = blocked)\n\n# Recent issues (last 7 days)\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND created >= -7d\n\n# My issues\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND assignee = currentUser()\n\n# Sprint issues\nproject = YOUR_PROJECT AND component = \"YOUR_COMPONENT\" AND sprint in openSprints()\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Tool not found\" Error\n\nMake sure the Atlassian MCP Server is enabled in your IDE settings. The tools won''t appear until the server is connected.\n\n### Authentication Issues\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server uses OAuth. If you''re not authenticated:\n\n1. The tool will prompt you to authenticate\n2. Follow the OAuth flow in your browser\n3. Grant the necessary permissions\n\n### Rate Limits\n\nThe Atlassian MCP Server is subject to Atlassian''s rate limits. If you hit limits:\n\n- Reduce query frequency\n- Use more specific JQL to reduce result sets\n- Cache results when appropriate\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:33.159Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents like Cursor or Claude Code needing seamless access to JIRA and Confluence data","zh":"适合于像Cursor或Claude Code这样的编码代理，需要无缝访问JIRA和Confluence数据","ja":"CursorまたはClaude Codeのようなコーディングエージェントに最適で、JIRAおよびConfluenceデータへのシームレスなアクセスが必要","ko":"Cursor 또는 Claude Code와 같은 코딩 에이전트에 적합하며, JIRA 및 Confluence 데이터에 대한无缝한 액세스가 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Codificación como Cursor o Claude Code que necesitan acceso sin problemas a los datos de JIRA y Confluence","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage comme Cursor ou Claude Code nécessitant un accès sans problème aux données JIRA et Confluence","de":"Perfekt für Codierungsagenten wie Cursor oder Claude Code, die einen nahtlosen Zugriff auf JIRA- und Confluence-Daten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de codificação como Cursor ou Claude Code que precisam de acesso sem interrupções aos dados do JIRA e Confluence","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования, таких как Cursor или Claude Code, которым необходим беспрепятственный доступ к данным JIRA и Confluence","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البرمجيين مثل Cursor أو Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى الوصول الخالي من العيوب إلى بيانات JIRA و Confluence"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to directly access Atlassian data using the Atlassian MCP Server, enabling seamless integration with JIRA and Confluence through MCP protocols and JSON configuration files","zh":"能够让代理直接访问Atlassian数据，使用Atlassian MCP Server，通过MCP协议和JSON配置文件实现JIRA和Confluence的无缝集成","ja":"Atlassian MCPサーバーを使用して、エージェントがAtlassianデータに直接アクセスできるようにし、MCPプロトコルとJSON設定ファイルを介してJIRAおよびConfluenceとのシームレスな統合を可能にします","ko":"Atlassian MCP 서버를 사용하여 에이전트가 Atlassian 데이터에 직접 액세스할 수 있도록 하며, MCP 프로토콜 및 JSON 구성 파일을 통해 JIRA 및 Confluence와의 无缝한 통합을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a acceder directamente a los datos de Atlassian utilizando el servidor Atlassian MCP, permitiendo una integración sin problemas con JIRA y Confluence a través de protocolos MCP y archivos de configuración JSON","fr":"Permet aux agents d''accéder directement aux données Atlassian en utilisant le serveur Atlassian MCP, permettant une intégration sans problème avec JIRA et Confluence via les protocoles MCP et les fichiers de configuration JSON","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, direkt auf Atlassian-Daten über den Atlassian MCP-Server zuzugreifen, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit JIRA und Confluence über MCP-Protokolle und JSON-Konfigurationsdateien ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acessarem diretamente os dados da Atlassian usando o Servidor Atlassian MCP, permitindo uma integração sem interrupções com o JIRA e Confluence por meio de protocolos MCP e arquivos de configuração JSON","ru":"Предоставляет агентам прямой доступ к данным Atlassian с помощью сервера Atlassian MCP, обеспечивая беспрепятственную интеграцию с JIRA и Confluence посредством протоколов MCP и файлов конфигурации JSON","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الوصول المباشر إلى بيانات Atlassian باستخدام خادم Atlassian MCP، وتمكين التكامل الخالي من العيوب مع JIRA و Confluence من خلال بروتوكولات MCP وملفات التكوين JSON"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating JIRA issue tracking","Generating Confluence documentation","Debugging Atlassian data integration issues"],"zh":["自动化JIRA问题跟踪","生成Confluence文档","调试Atlassian数据集成问题"],"ja":["JIRA問題の追跡の自動化","Confluenceドキュメントの生成","Atlassianデータ統合の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["JIRA 문제 추적 자동화","Confluence 문서 생성","Atlassian 데이터 통합 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización del seguimiento de problemas de JIRA","Generación de documentación de Confluence","Depuración de problemas de integración de datos de Atlassian"],"fr":["Automatisation du suivi des problèmes JIRA","Génération de documentation Confluence","Débogage des problèmes d''intégration des données Atlassian"],"de":["Automatisierung der JIRA-Problemmeldung","Generierung von Confluence-Dokumentation","Fehlerbehebung bei der Atlassian-Dateneinbindung"],"pt":["Automatizar o rastreamento de problemas do JIRA","Gerar documentação do Confluence","Depurar problemas de integração de dados da Atlassian"],"ru":["Автоматизация отслеживания проблем JIRA","Генерация документации Confluence","Отладка проблем интеграции данных Atlassian"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لتتبع قضايا JIRA","توليد توثيق Confluence","تصحيح أخطاء دمج بيانات Atlassian"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Atlassian MCP Server setup","Configuration through ~/.cursor/mcp.json file"],"zh":["需要Atlassian MCP Server设置","通过~/.cursor/mcp.json文件配置"],"ja":["Atlassian MCPサーバーの設定が必要","~/.cursor/mcp.jsonファイルを介した設定"],"ko":["Atlassian MCP 서버 설정이 필요합니다","~/.cursor/mcp.json 파일을 통한 구성"],"es":["Requiere la configuración del servidor Atlassian MCP","Configuración a través del archivo ~/.cursor/mcp.json"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du serveur Atlassian MCP","Configuration via le fichier ~/.cursor/mcp.json"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung des Atlassian MCP-Servers","Konfiguration über die Datei ~/.cursor/mcp.json"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Servidor Atlassian MCP","Configuração por meio do arquivo ~/.cursor/mcp.json"],"ru":["Требуется настройка сервера Atlassian MCP","Настройка через файл ~/.cursor/mcp.json"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد خادم Atlassian MCP","الإعداد من خلال ملف ~/.cursor/mcp.json"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"bcbbf0c70289a046e14596f6d4bedb6367ee80f8ccfd0823e9ed03b0f045f809","qualityScore":33}');
